        "## Experiment 20 — Step 2.2\n",
        "### Image-Level Pairing and Data Provenance Verification\n",
        "\n",
        "Objective:\n",
        "Verify that original, low-illumination, and high-illumination embeddings\n",
        "at each row position correspond to the same source image.\n",
        "\n",
        "Audit:\n",
        "1. Inspect the Experiment 18 notebook's data-loading and pairing logic.\n",
        "2. Locate the creation of common_positions.\n",
        "3. Locate the construction of original_embeddings,\n",
        "   low_illumination_embeddings, and high_illumination_embeddings.\n",
        "4. Verify how paired_labels were assigned.\n",
        "5. Identify any filtering caused by face-detection failures.\n",
        "6. Determine whether the archive preserves a reproducible mapping\n",
        "   to the original LFW images.\n",
        "\n",
        "No embeddings will be modified or regenerated."
      ],
