      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## Experiment 20 — Step 2.5\n",
        "### Dataset Suitability and Experimental Protocol Decision\n",
        "\n",
        "**Proposed research title**\n",
        "\n",
        "Paired Identity-Level Evaluation of Within-Identity Embedding Drift Detection Under Controlled Biometric Acquisition Changes\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Dataset strategy\n",
        "\n",
        "A two-stage experimental design is adopted.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Stage 1 — Development dataset**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Dataset: Existing LFW-derived Experiment 18 illumination cohort.\n",
        "- Paired observations: 889.\n",
        "- Identities: 13.\n",
        "- Embedding dimension: 512.\n",
        "- Embedding model: InceptionResnetV1.\n",
        "- Pretrained weights: VGGFace2.\n",
        "- Acquisition conditions: Original, low illumination and high illumination.\n",
        "- Purpose: Develop and evaluate paired within-identity drift detection methods.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Stage 2 — Independent validation dataset**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Dataset: Extended Yale Face Database B.\n",
        "- Purpose: Independently evaluate the frozen Stage 1 methodology.\n",
        "- Acquisition variable: Illumination.\n",
        "- Embeddings: Freshly generated using the selected embedding model, subject to compatibility and extraction checks.\n",
        "- Pairing: Match observations by identity and pose across illumination conditions.\n",
        "- Purpose: Evaluate whether the Stage 1 findings transfer to a separate dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "CMU Multi-PIE is retained as a possible future external validation dataset, not part of the current primary design.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Research scope\n",
        "\n",
        "The primary focus is illumination-induced within-identity embedding drift.\n",
        "\n",
        "Other acquisition variables, including blur, noise and compression, are excluded from the current experiment.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. Detector methodology\n",
        "\n",
        "The planned detector families are:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Global Euclidean distance.\n",
        "2. Global Mahalanobis distance.\n",
        "3. Identity-conditioned standardized Euclidean distance.\n",
        "\n",
        "Detector definitions, calibration procedures and thresholds must be developed using Stage 1 only.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Stage 2 validation dataset must not be used to tune detector parameters or thresholds.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4. Data separation and leakage prevention\n",
        "\n",
        "- Keep matched source-image observations together within their assigned partitions.\n",
        "- Separate model fitting, calibration and evaluation data.\n",
        "- Do not use Stage 2 observations for Stage 1 model fitting or threshold selection.\n",
        "- Freeze the Stage 1 methodology before Stage 2 evaluation.\n",
        "- Report extraction failures separately from embedding-drift detection results.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. Important limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "- The existing LFW cohort contains only 13 identities.\n",
        "- One identity accounts for 56.69% of the 889 paired observations.\n",
        "- The existing cohort excludes 67 of 956 original evaluation positions because of extraction failures under at least one illumination condition.\n",
        "- Extended Yale B is grayscale, whereas the existing pipeline uses an InceptionResnetV1 model pretrained on VGGFace2.\n",
        "- Preprocessing compatibility and extraction success must be tested before Stage 2 is accepted.\n",
        "- Cross-dataset validation does not automatically establish generalisation to unconstrained real-world biometric systems.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 6. Decisions and pending items\n",
        "\n",
        "**Agreed decisions**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Dataset strategy: Existing plus independent dataset.\n",
        "- Stage 1: Existing LFW paired cohort.\n",
        "- Stage 2: Extended Yale B.\n",
        "- Acquisition scope: Illumination only.\n",
        "- Validation: Frozen Stage 1 methodology on Stage 2.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Pending technical verification**\n",
        "\n",
        "- Dataset download and usage conditions.\n",
        "- Source-image and identity metadata.\n",
        "- Exact image-level pairing strategy.\n",
        "- Grayscale preprocessing compatibility.\n",
        "- Embedding extraction success.\n",
        "- Final partition sizes and random seeds.\n",
        "- Detector calibration and evaluation configuration.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Step 2.5 status**\n",
        "\n",
        "Research design agreed. Technical feasibility of the independent dataset remains to be verified in Step 2.6.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "IEShJYmBa4wQ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 2.5\n",
        "# FORMAL RESEARCH DESIGN DECISION RECORD\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import json\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. Define output location\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "output_dir = Path(\n",
        "    \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_20_Results/design\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "output_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "output_file = output_dir / \"experiment20_stage_design.json\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. Record agreed research decisions\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "design_record = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": 20,\n",
        "    \"step\": \"2.5\",\n",
        "    \"title\": (\n",
        "        \"Paired Identity-Level Evaluation of Within-Identity \"\n",
        "        \"Embedding Drift Detection Under Controlled \"\n",
        "        \"Biometric Acquisition Changes\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"dataset_strategy\": \"existing_plus_independent_validation\",\n",
        "    \"stage_1\": {\n",
        "        \"dataset\": \"LFW\",\n",
        "        \"source\": \"Existing Experiment 18 illumination cohort\",\n",
        "        \"paired_observations\": 889,\n",
        "        \"identities\": 13,\n",
        "        \"embedding_dimension\": 512,\n",
        "        \"model\": \"InceptionResnetV1\",\n",
        "        \"pretrained_weights\": \"VGGFace2\",\n",
        "        \"purpose\": \"Method development and calibration\"\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"stage_2\": {\n",
        "        \"dataset\": \"Extended Yale Face Database B\",\n",
        "        \"purpose\": \"Independent validation\",\n",
        "        \"embedding_generation\": \"Fresh extraction required\",\n",
        "        \"pairing_strategy\": \"Identity and pose matched across illumination conditions\",\n",
        "        \"status\": \"Pending acquisition and technical feasibility audit\"\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"acquisition_scope\": [\n",
        "        \"illumination\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"excluded_acquisition_variables\": [\n",
        "        \"blur\",\n",
        "        \"noise\",\n",
        "        \"compression\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"planned_detectors\": [\n",
        "        \"global_euclidean\",\n",
        "        \"global_mahalanobis\",\n",
        "        \"identity_conditioned_standardized_euclidean\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"validation_protocol\": {\n",
        "        \"stage_1_threshold_calibration\": True,\n",
        "        \"freeze_stage_1_methodology_before_stage_2\": True,\n",
        "        \"stage_2_threshold_retuning\": False,\n",
        "        \"stage_2_used_for_stage_1_tuning\": False,\n",
        "        \"report_extraction_failures_separately\": True,\n",
        "        \"prevent_source_image_partition_leakage\": True\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"known_limitations\": [\n",
        "        \"Only 13 identities in the existing LFW paired cohort\",\n",
        "        \"One identity represents 56.69 percent of paired observations\",\n",
        "        \"67 of 956 original evaluation positions were excluded\",\n",
        "        \"Extended Yale B is grayscale\",\n",
        "        \"Embedding preprocessing compatibility remains unverified\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"pending_verifications\": [\n",
        "        \"Dataset access and usage conditions\",\n",
        "        \"Source image and identity metadata\",\n",
        "        \"Image-level pairing\",\n",
        "        \"Grayscale preprocessing compatibility\",\n",
        "        \"Embedding extraction success\",\n",
        "        \"Partition sizes and random seeds\",\n",
        "        \"Detector calibration and evaluation configuration\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "    \"decision_status\": \"DESIGN_AGREED_TECHNICAL_VALIDATION_PENDING\",\n",
        "    \"created_utc\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. Save the decision record\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(output_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    json.dump(design_record, file, indent=4)\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. Reopen and verify the saved record\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(output_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    verified_record = json.load(file)\n",
        "\n",
        "assert verified_record[\"experiment\"] == 20\n",
        "assert verified_record[\"step\"] == \"2.5\"\n",
        "assert verified_record[\"stage_1\"][\"paired_observations\"] == 889\n",
        "assert verified_record[\"stage_2\"][\"dataset\"] == \"Extended Yale Face Database B\"\n",
        "assert verified_record[\"validation_protocol\"][\"stage_2_threshold_retuning\"] is False\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 2.5\")\n",
        "print(\"RESEARCH DESIGN DECISION RECORD\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Output file:\", output_file)\n",
        "print(\"File exists:\", output_file.exists())\n",
        "print(\"File size:\", output_file.stat().st_size, \"bytes\")\n",
        "print(\"JSON reload verification: PASSED\")\n",
        "print(\"Stage 1 dataset:\", verified_record[\"stage_1\"][\"dataset\"])\n",
        "print(\"Stage 2 dataset:\", verified_record[\"stage_2\"][\"dataset\"])\n",
