        "## EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 2.6.8: IMAGE NAMING AND CONDITION COMPLETENESS AUDIT\n",
        "\n",
        "Inspect all PGM filenames in the Cropped Extended Yale B archive.\n",
        "\n",
        "Objectives:\n",
        "1. List all 38 unmatched PGM filenames.\n",
        "2. Determine whether they represent ambient images or another image category.\n",
        "3. Identify duplicate image-condition filenames.\n",
        "4. Identify missing illumination combinations for each subject.\n",
        "5. Inspect subject metadata files where available.\n",
        "6. Save the results without extracting or modifying the archive.\n",
        "\n",
        "No images will be excluded or accepted based on assumptions."
      ],
