            "### Validation Criteria\n",
            "- Successful dataset download.\n",
            "- Availability of facial images and identity labels.\n",
            "- Verification of the number of images and unique identities.\n",
            "\n",
            "### Status\n",
            "\n",
            "Successfully completed. The Labeled Faces in the Wild (LFW) dataset was downloaded using the official scikit-learn dataset interface. The dataset contains 3,023 facial images from 62 identities, with an image resolution of 125 × 94 pixels and three RGB channels. Image data and identity labels were successfully loaded.\n",
            "\n",
