            "## Step 17.10 — Final Validation and Reproducibility Audit\n",
            "\n",
            "### Objective\n",
            "\n",
            "This stage performs a final audit of Experiment 18 to verify data integrity, numerical consistency, experimental configuration and reproducibility.\n",
            "\n",
            "The audit is divided into the following subsections:\n",
            "\n",
            "- **Step 17.10.1:** Data Integrity Audit\n",
            "- **Step 17.10.2:** Detector and Statistical Result Consistency\n",
            "- **Step 17.10.3:** Experimental Configuration and Reproducibility\n",
            "- **Step 17.10.4:** Saved Results and Output Verification\n",
            "- **Step 17.10.5:** Final Experiment Validation Summary\n",
