            "\n",
            "- Image-level displacement: p = 4.708938 × 10⁻⁸⁰.\n",
            "- Identity-level displacement: p = 0.001220703125.\n",
            "\n",
            "The corrected Step 17 detector-response results validated in Step 17.10.2 were:\n",
            "\n",
            "- Euclidean: p = 0.021484.\n",
            "- Mahalanobis: p = 0.002441.\n",
