            "All four records passed provenance validation. The historical metadata was preserved without modification.\n",
            "\n",
            "These results represent separate statistical analyses and must not be substituted for one another.\n",
            "\n",
            "**Status: Successfully Completed**\n",
            "\n",
            "The saved results and output verification audit completed successfully.\n",
            "\n",
            "Seven saved files were identified and inspected. Both NumPy archives, the identity-level CSV summary and JSON metadata records were examined. The corrected detector-response statistical results were verified against the current in-memory table, and the corrected 229-image evaluation cohort was independently confirmed.\n",
