            "---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
            "### Step 17.10.6.3 — Research Discussion and Interpretation\n",
            "\n",
            "Objective: Develop a cautious research interpretation of the consolidated experimental findings.\n",
            "\n",
            "Scope:\n",
            "1. Interpret Euclidean and Mahalanobis detector behaviour across illumination conditions.\n",
            "2. Discuss differences between aggregate and identity-level responses.\n",
            "3. Interpret statistical significance and effect-size evidence.\n",
            "4. Explain the relationship between embedding displacement and detector response.\n",
            "5. Identify implications for biometric drift monitoring.\n",
            "6. Separate demonstrated findings from hypotheses and future research directions.\n",
            "7. Document threats to validity and avoid unsupported claims.\n",
            "\n",
            "Expected outcome: A defensible discussion suitable for a research paper.\n",
            "\n",
            "No new embedding extraction, model training, or experimental data generation.\n",
            "\n",
