      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.1.2: Protocol and Preprocessing Review\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "Review the frozen analysis protocol and supporting audit records to identify methodological strengths, inconsistencies, and undocumented assumptions.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Documents examined\n",
        "1. experiment20_step27_descriptive_analysis_protocol.json\n",
        "2. experiment20_step271_protocol_feasibility_audit.json\n",
        "3. experiment20_step272_displacement_audit.json\n",
        "4. experiment20_step273_group_descriptive_audit.json\n",
        "5. experiment20_step277_final_freeze_audit.json\n",
        "\n",
        "## Review areas\n",
        "- Dataset cohort and common-condition selection\n",
        "- Reference and evaluation design\n",
        "- Illumination-angle calculations and grouping\n",
        "- Embedding preprocessing\n",
        "- Analysis-unit definitions\n",
        "- Documented methodological limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "## Restrictions\n",
        "- Read-only inspection.\n",
        "- No modifications to frozen results.\n",
        "- No new statistical tests.\n",
        "- Do not infer undocumented preprocessing details.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected output\n",
        "A structured evidence report separating:\n",
        "1. What the documents explicitly establish.\n",
        "2. What remains ambiguous or insufficiently documented.\n",
        "3. Methodological issues requiring correction or qualification in the manuscript."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "e5BltjQHr9ae"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import json\n",
        "\n",
        "ROOT = Path(\n",
        "    \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_20_Results/step_2_7/final_freeze\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "FILES = {\n",
        "    \"protocol\": \"experiment20_step27_descriptive_analysis_protocol.json\",\n",
        "    \"protocol_audit\": \"experiment20_step271_protocol_feasibility_audit.json\",\n",
        "    \"displacement_audit\": \"experiment20_step272_displacement_audit.json\",\n",
        "    \"group_audit\": \"experiment20_step273_group_descriptive_audit.json\",\n",
        "    \"freeze_audit\": \"experiment20_step277_final_freeze_audit.json\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "def load_json(filename):\n",
        "    path = ROOT / filename\n",
        "    if not path.exists():\n",
        "        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Required frozen file missing: {path}\")\n",
        "    with path.open(\"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n",
        "        return json.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "documents = {\n",
        "    name: load_json(filename)\n",
        "    for name, filename in FILES.items()\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "def print_section(title):\n",
        "    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 100)\n",
        "    print(title)\n",
        "    print(\"=\" * 100)\n",
        "\n",
        "def print_value(label, value):\n",
        "    print(f\"\\n{label}:\")\n",
        "    print(json.dumps(value, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False, default=str))\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. Protocol overview\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "protocol = documents[\"protocol\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"1. FROZEN PROTOCOL — CORE DESIGN\")\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"experiment\",\n",
        "    \"step\",\n",
        "    \"title\",\n",
        "    \"protocol_status\",\n",
        "    \"analysis_type\",\n",
        "    \"dataset\",\n",
        "    \"unit_of_analysis\",\n",
        "    \"illumination_groups\",\n",
        "    \"hemisphere_counts\",\n",
        "    \"primary_metrics\",\n",
        "    \"secondary_analysis\",\n",
        "    \"statistical_plan\",\n",
        "    \"detector_feasibility\",\n",
        "    \"preprocessing\",\n",
        "    \"limitations\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if key in protocol:\n",
        "        print_value(key, protocol[key])\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        print(f\"\\nMISSING PROTOCOL FIELD: {key}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. Protocol feasibility audit\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"2. PROTOCOL FEASIBILITY AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "protocol_audit = documents[\"protocol_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"audit_status\",\n",
        "    \"reference_condition\",\n",
        "    \"reference_observations\",\n",
        "    \"evaluation_conditions\",\n",
        "    \"evaluation_observations\",\n",
        "    \"group_condition_counts\",\n",
        "    \"evaluation_group_counts\",\n",
        "    \"hemisphere_counts\",\n",
        "    \"statistical_feasibility\",\n",
        "    \"audit_checks\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if key in protocol_audit:\n",
        "        print_value(key, protocol_audit[key])\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. Displacement audit\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"3. DISPLACEMENT AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "displacement_audit = documents[\"displacement_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"audit_status\",\n",
        "    \"reference_condition\",\n",
        "    \"reference_embeddings\",\n",
        "    \"common_conditions\",\n",
        "    \"evaluation_conditions\",\n",
        "    \"evaluation_records\",\n",
        "    \"unique_identities\",\n",
        "    \"unique_evaluation_conditions\",\n",
        "    \"group_observation_counts\",\n",
        "    \"displacement_summary\",\n",
        "    \"interpretation_limitations\",\n",
        "    \"audit_checks\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if key in displacement_audit:\n",
        "        print_value(key, displacement_audit[key])\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. Group descriptive audit\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"4. GROUP DESCRIPTIVE AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "group_audit = documents[\"group_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"audit_status\",\n",
        "    \"input_records\",\n",
        "    \"unique_identities\",\n",
        "    \"group_observation_counts\",\n",
        "    \"identity_level_records\",\n",
        "    \"identity_group_counts\",\n",
        "    \"interpretation_limitations\",\n",
        "    \"audit_checks\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if key in group_audit:\n",
        "        print_value(key, group_audit[key])\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 5. Final freeze audit\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"5. FINAL FREEZE AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "freeze_audit = documents[\"freeze_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"audit_status\",\n",
        "    \"frozen_artifact_count\",\n",
        "    \"freeze_directory\",\n",
        "    \"audit_checks\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if key in freeze_audit:\n",
        "        print_value(key, freeze_audit[key])\n",
        "\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 6. Explicit evidence gaps\n",
        "# ---------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"6. DOCUMENTATION GAP CHECK\")\n",
        "\n",
        "checks = {\n",
        "    \"Dataset provenance documented\": (\n",
        "        \"dataset\" in protocol\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Reference condition documented\": (\n",
        "        \"reference_condition\" in protocol_audit\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Evaluation cohort documented\": (\n",
        "        \"evaluation_conditions\" in protocol_audit\n",
        "        and \"evaluation_observations\" in protocol_audit\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Preprocessing documented\": (\n",
        "        \"preprocessing\" in protocol\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Analysis unit documented\": (\n",
        "        \"unit_of_analysis\" in protocol\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Interpretation limitations documented\": (\n",
        "        \"limitations\" in protocol\n",
        "        or \"interpretation_limitations\" in displacement_audit\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Final freeze audit present\": (\n",
        "        freeze_audit.get(\"audit_status\") is not None\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "for label, passed in checks.items():\n",
        "    print(f\"{'PRESENT' if passed else 'MISSING'}: {label}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print_section(\"7. REVIEW STATUS\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Protocol and audit documents loaded successfully.\")\n",
        "print(\"This step checks documentation, not the truth of every methodological claim.\")\n",
        "print(\"No frozen files were modified.\")\n",
        "print(\"\\nEND OF STEP 3.1.2\")"
      ],
