            "[1] TORCHVISION VERSION\n",
            "Installed version: 0.29.1+cpu\n",
            "\n",
            "Resize API signature:\n",
            "(size, interpolation=<InterpolationMode.BILINEAR: 'bilinear'>, max_size=None, antialias=True)\n",
