        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.1.14\n",
        "## Resolve Resize Interpolation Documentation\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Update D02 using the original notebook source and\n",
        "Step 3.1.10 API inspection.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Recovered evidence\n",
        "Original invocation:\n",
        "transforms.Resize((160, 160))\n",
        "\n",
        "Recorded torchvision version:\n",
        "0.29.1+cpu\n",
        "\n",
        "Inspected API defaults:\n",
        "- Interpolation: BILINEAR\n",
        "- Antialias: True\n",
        "\n",
        "### Documentation decision\n",
        "Record bilinear interpolation and antialiasing as the\n",
        "effective torchvision defaults for the original Resize call.\n",
        "\n",
        "Explicitly disclose that these parameters were not\n",
        "specified in the original notebook invocation.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Restrictions\n",
        "- Update D02 only.\n",
        "- Preserve D01, D03, D04 and D05.\n",
        "- Preserve a backup of the current register.\n",
        "- Recalculate the submission-blocking count.\n",
        "- Validate the saved JSON."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wC6Gvnvfxnai"
      }
    },
