        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.1.15\n",
        "## Finalise Model Checkpoint and Software Reproducibility Record\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Review the recovered original notebook and software evidence\n",
        "and update D03.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Established evidence\n",
        "- Model: InceptionResnetV1\n",
        "- Pretrained identifier: VGGFace2\n",
        "- facenet-pytorch: 2.6.0\n",
        "- PyTorch: 2.14.1+cpu\n",
        "- torchvision: 0.29.1+cpu\n",
        "- Python: 3.13.18\n",
        "- Model evaluation mode enabled.\n",
        "- Gradient computation disabled during embedding extraction.\n",
        "- Embedding dimension: 512.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Unresolved limitation\n",
        "The exact pretrained weight-file identity and SHA256 checksum\n",
        "were not preserved or recovered.\n",
        "\n",
        "The embedding-progress checkpoint is not the FaceNet\n",
        "model-weight checkpoint.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Decision\n",
        "Record D03 as a known reproducibility limitation.\n",
        "Do not invent or infer a model-weight checksum.\n",
        "Disclose the missing checkpoint identity in the manuscript.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Restrictions\n",
        "- Update D03 only.\n",
        "- Preserve D01, D02, D04 and D05.\n",
        "- Preserve a backup of the current decision register.\n",
        "- Recalculate the submission-blocking count.\n",
        "- Validate the saved JSON."
      ],
