        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.2.5\n",
        "## Additional Model Feasibility and Runtime Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Inspect the current Google Colab environment before selecting\n",
        "and implementing additional pretrained face-recognition models.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Candidate models\n",
        "1. AdaFace IR-50.\n",
        "2. InsightFace ArcFace ResNet50 (buffalo_l).\n",
        "\n",
        "### Inspection\n",
        "- GPU availability and type.\n",
        "- Available RAM and disk space.\n",
        "- Python and PyTorch versions.\n",
        "- Relevant installed packages.\n",
        "- Existing local model-weight caches.\n",
        "- Existing Experiment 20 embedding archive availability.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Restrictions\n",
        "- Read-only inspection.\n",
        "- No package installation.\n",
        "- No model downloads.\n",
        "- No embedding regeneration.\n",
        "- No modification of frozen Experiment 20 results.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Decision\n",
        "Model implementation begins only after hardware, package\n",
        "compatibility, storage and preprocessing feasibility are reviewed."
