      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.2.11\n",
        "## External Verification of Candidate Model Requirements\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Record verified implementation and preprocessing requirements for\n",
        "ArcFace, AdaFace, and MagFace.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Verified findings\n",
        "\n",
        "#### ArcFace / InsightFace\n",
        "- Official pretrained model zoo is available.\n",
        "- Documented recognition input uses aligned 112 × 112 face images.\n",
        "- Recognition normalization is model-specific.\n",
        "- Pretrained InsightFace model packs are restricted to non-commercial\n",
        "  research use.\n",
        "\n",
        "#### AdaFace\n",
        "- Official pretrained IR-50 and IR-100 checkpoints are listed.\n",
        "- Inference expects 112 × 112 BGR input.\n",
        "- Input normalization uses mean 0.5 and standard deviation 0.5.\n",
        "- Official inference example uses facial-landmark alignment.\n",
        "\n",
        "#### MagFace\n",
        "- Official CVPR 2021 paper and implementation are available.\n",
        "- The implementation specifies five-landmark alignment to 112 × 112.\n",
        "- Exact checkpoint and preprocessing compatibility remain to be verified.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Methodological decision\n",
        "No additional model is selected at this stage.\n",
        "\n",
        "The existing Yale B cohort was processed without successful MTCNN\n",
        "alignment. The candidate implementations document aligned face inputs.\n",
        "Simply resizing the existing images would not establish preprocessing\n",
        "compatibility.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Next requirement\n",
        "Assess whether a reliable landmark-alignment method can process the\n",
        "existing Yale B image cohort. Do not alter the frozen source images or\n",
        "existing FaceNet embeddings.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Restrictions\n",
        "- No model downloads.\n",
        "- No package installations.\n",
        "- No inference.\n",
        "- No changes to frozen data.\n",
        "- No model selection until alignment feasibility is assessed."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QlLepbCt5C6d"
      }
    },
