    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.2.18\n",
        "## Alignment Strategy Decision\n",
        "\n",
        "### Evidence\n",
        "MediaPipe Face Landmarker was evaluated on 30 predefined images.\n",
        "\n",
        "Results:\n",
        "- Near-frontal: 8/10 successful.\n",
        "- Oblique: 8/10 successful.\n",
        "- Large-angular: 2/10 successful.\n",
        "- Overall: 18/30 successful.\n",
        "- No-face detections: 11.\n",
        "- Multiple-face detections: 1.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Decision\n",
        "Reject MediaPipe as the full-cohort alignment method in its\n",
        "current configuration.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Reasons\n",
        "1. Detection failure is concentrated in large-angular illumination.\n",
        "2. Successful-only processing would create selection bias.\n",
        "3. Unequal image coverage would weaken group comparisons.\n",
        "4. The pilot does not establish reliable alignment across conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Existing results\n",
        "The original FaceNet embeddings and descriptive analysis remain\n",
        "unchanged. This decision applies only to the proposed additional\n",
        "model evaluation.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Remaining options\n",
        "A. Retain the original FaceNet-only descriptive study.\n",
        "B. Investigate a different alignment method using the same\n",
        "   predefined pilot sample.\n",
        "C. Redesign the additional-model evaluation around a clearly\n",
        "   documented common preprocessing procedure, if technically\n",
        "   and scientifically defensible.\n",
        "\n",
        "No option is approved automatically.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Restrictions\n",
        "- No further model inference.\n",
        "- No aligned image generation.\n",
        "- No changes to frozen images.\n",
        "- No changes to existing embeddings."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "txkWDt8k7ZCc"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import json\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "BASE = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_20_Results\")\n",
        "STEP_DIR = BASE / \"step_3_2\"\n",
        "\n",
        "INPUT_FILE = STEP_DIR / (\n",
        "    \"experiment20_step3217_detection_failure_analysis.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "OUTPUT_FILE = STEP_DIR / (\n",
        "    \"experiment20_step3218_alignment_strategy_decision.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "assert INPUT_FILE.exists(), \"Step 3.2.17 audit missing.\"\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(INPUT_FILE) as f:\n",
        "    failure_audit = json.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "assert failure_audit[\"total_images\"] == 30\n",
        "\n",
        "failure_counts = failure_audit[\"failure_type_counts\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "successes = failure_counts[\"successful_478_landmark_detection\"]\n",
        "no_face = failure_counts[\"no_face_detected\"]\n",
        "multiple_faces = failure_counts[\"multiple_faces_detected\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "assert successes == 18\n",
        "assert no_face == 11\n",
        "assert multiple_faces == 1\n",
        "\n",
        "large_angular = failure_audit[\"group_failure_analysis\"][\"large_angular\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "assert large_angular[\"successful_478_landmark_detection\"] == 2\n",
        "assert large_angular[\"no_face_detected\"] == 8\n",
        "\n",
        "decision = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": \"Experiment 20\",\n",
        "    \"step\": \"3.2.18\",\n",
        "    \"timestamp_utc\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"evidence_source\": str(INPUT_FILE),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"pilot_results\": {\n",
        "        \"total_images\": 30,\n",
        "        \"successful_detections\": successes,\n",
        "        \"no_face_detections\": no_face,\n",
        "        \"multiple_face_detections\": multiple_faces,\n",
        "        \"overall_success_rate\": successes / 30,\n",
        "        \"group_results\": {\n",
        "            group: {\n",
        "                \"successful\": counts.get(\n",
        "                    \"successful_478_landmark_detection\", 0\n",
        "                ),\n",
        "                \"no_face\": counts.get(\"no_face_detected\", 0),\n",
        "                \"multiple_faces\": counts.get(\n",
        "                    \"multiple_faces_detected\", 0\n",
        "                )\n",
        "            }\n",
        "            for group, counts in failure_audit[\n",
        "                \"group_failure_analysis\"\n",
        "            ].items()\n",
        "        }\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"decision\": (\n",
        "        \"REJECT_MEDIAPIPE_FOR_FULL_COHORT_ALIGNMENT\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"reasons\": [\n",
        "        \"Overall pilot detection success was 18/30.\",\n",
        "        \"Large-angular detection success was only 2/10.\",\n",
        "        \"Eight of ten large-angular images had no face detected.\",\n",
        "        \"Successful-only processing would introduce selection bias.\",\n",
        "        \"The pilot does not establish reliable full-cohort alignment.\"\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"impact_on_existing_analysis\": {\n",
        "        \"original_facenet_embeddings_modified\": False,\n",
        "        \"original_displacement_results_modified\": False,\n",
        "        \"original_dataset_modified\": False,\n",
        "        \"existing_descriptive_analysis_invalidated\": False\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"remaining_options\": {\n",
        "        \"A\": \"Retain the original FaceNet-only descriptive study.\",\n",
        "        \"B\": \"Investigate a different alignment method using the same pilot.\",\n",
        "        \"C\": \"Redesign additional-model evaluation around defensible \"\n",
        "             \"common preprocessing.\"\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"model_selection\": \"NONE\",\n",
        "    \"full_cohort_alignment_authorized\": False,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"restrictions\": {\n",
        "        \"additional_inference\": False,\n",
        "        \"aligned_images_generated\": False,\n",
        "        \"embeddings_regenerated\": False,\n",
        "        \"frozen_data_modified\": False\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"status\": \"ALIGNMENT_STRATEGY_DECISION_RECORDED\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(OUTPUT_FILE, \"w\") as f:\n",
        "    json.dump(decision, f, indent=2)\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(OUTPUT_FILE) as f:\n",
        "    reloaded = json.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 88)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 3.2.18\")\n",
        "print(\"ALIGNMENT STRATEGY DECISION\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 88)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Overall success:\", successes, \"/ 30\")\n",
        "print(\"No face detected:\", no_face)\n",
        "print(\"Multiple faces:\", multiple_faces)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nGroup results:\")\n",
        "for group, values in decision[\"pilot_results\"][\"group_results\"].items():\n",
        "    print(group, values)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nDecision:\", decision[\"decision\"])\n",
        "print(\"Existing FaceNet results modified: NO\")\n",
        "print(\"Full-cohort alignment authorized: NO\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nJSON reload:\", \"PASS\" if reloaded == decision else \"FAIL\")\n",
        "print(\"Saved:\", OUTPUT_FILE)\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 88)"
      ],
