    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.2.19\n",
        "## Publication Strategy Decision\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Select a defensible publication direction based on the completed\n",
        "Yale B analysis and additional-model feasibility investigation.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Available strategies\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Strategy A — Descriptive empirical study\n",
        "Retain the existing FaceNet-only analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "Scope:\n",
        "- One pretrained FaceNet architecture.\n",
        "- 38 identities.\n",
        "- 57 common illumination conditions.\n",
        "- 2,128 evaluation observations.\n",
        "- Reference-relative Euclidean and cosine displacement.\n",
        "- Three illumination geometry groups.\n",
        "- Identity-level repeated-measures comparisons.\n",
        "- Exploratory hemisphere comparison.\n",
        "\n",
        "Limitations:\n",
        "- No recognition accuracy evaluation.\n",
        "- No calibrated drift detector.\n",
        "- No independent architecture validation.\n",
        "- Illumination effects cannot be isolated completely from\n",
        "  differences between captured images.\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Strategy B — Multi-architecture robustness study\n",
        "Requires additional models and a defensible common preprocessing\n",
        "and alignment protocol.\n",
        "\n",
        "Current status:\n",
        "Not feasible using the tested MediaPipe alignment configuration.\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Strategy C — Biometric drift detection methodology\n",
        "Requires a separately designed study with:\n",
        "- Multiple reference captures.\n",
        "- Sequential or temporal drift conditions.\n",
        "- Explicit detection algorithms.\n",
        "- Threshold calibration.\n",
        "- False-alarm and detection-delay evaluation.\n",
        "- Independent validation.\n",
        "\n",
        "Current status:\n",
        "Not part of the completed Experiment 20 analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Selected strategy\n",
        "Strategy A — Descriptive empirical study.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Publication positioning\n",
        "Present the work as a controlled, identity-level descriptive\n",
        "analysis of reference-relative FaceNet embedding displacement\n",
        "across illumination geometry conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "Do not describe the work as:\n",
        "- A validated biometric drift detector.\n",
        "- A robust face-recognition system.\n",
        "- A fairness evaluation.\n",
        "- A multi-model generalisation study.\n",
        "- A deployment-ready biometric framework.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Additional-model investigation\n",
        "Record the MediaPipe feasibility failure as a methodological\n",
        "limitation of the proposed extension. Do not mix its pilot\n",
        "results into the main FaceNet displacement analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Status\n",
        "Publication strategy selected provisionally.\n",
        "Target journal or conference not yet selected."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "755rbat27oSs"
      }
    },
