    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.1\n",
        "## Working Title, Research Question and Contributions\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Working Title\n",
        "\n",
        "Reference-Relative Face Embedding Displacement Across\n",
        "Illumination Geometry Conditions: An Identity-Level Empirical Study\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Central Research Question\n",
        "\n",
        "How does reference-relative FaceNet embedding displacement vary\n",
        "across illumination geometry conditions, and how consistently\n",
        "are these differences observed across individual identities?\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. Supporting Research Questions\n",
        "\n",
        "RQ1:\n",
        "How do Euclidean embedding displacement and cosine distance\n",
        "vary across near-frontal, oblique, and large-angular illumination\n",
        "conditions?\n",
        "\n",
        "RQ2:\n",
        "Are the differences between illumination geometry groups\n",
        "consistent across the evaluated identities?\n",
        "\n",
        "RQ3:\n",
        "How do reference-relative embedding displacement patterns differ\n",
        "between frontal and beyond-frontal illumination conditions?\n",
        "\n",
        "RQ3 is exploratory because hemisphere comparisons involve\n",
        "unequal numbers of illumination conditions and are confounded\n",
        "with angular geometry.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4. Research Objectives\n",
        "\n",
        "O1:\n",
        "Construct identity-level reference-relative embedding\n",
        "displacement measurements using a fixed pretrained FaceNet model.\n",
        "\n",
        "O2:\n",
        "Characterise Euclidean and cosine displacement across three\n",
        "illumination geometry groups.\n",
        "\n",
        "O3:\n",
        "Evaluate differences between illumination groups using\n",
        "repeated-measures statistical analysis.\n",
        "\n",
        "O4:\n",
        "Examine the consistency of illumination-related displacement\n",
        "patterns across identities.\n",
        "\n",
        "O5:\n",
        "Explore differences between frontal and beyond-frontal\n",
        "illumination conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. Proposed Contributions\n",
        "\n",
        "C1:\n",
        "An identity-level descriptive evaluation of reference-relative\n",
        "FaceNet embedding displacement across illumination geometry\n",
        "conditions using the Cropped Extended Yale B dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "C2:\n",
        "A comparative analysis of Euclidean displacement and cosine\n",
        "distance across three illumination geometry groups.\n",
        "\n",
        "C3:\n",
        "A repeated-measures statistical assessment of differences\n",
        "across illumination groups, including identity-level\n",
        "uncertainty estimates.\n",
        "\n",
        "C4:\n",
        "An exploratory analysis of frontal and beyond-frontal\n",
        "illumination conditions, with explicit acknowledgement of\n",
        "unequal condition counts and geometric confounding.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 6. Scope Restrictions\n",
        "\n",
        "The manuscript does not claim:\n",
        "- A new face-recognition architecture.\n",
        "- Improved biometric recognition accuracy.\n",
        "- A validated biometric drift detector.\n",
        "- Fairness or demographic-bias mitigation.\n",
        "- Independent cross-architecture generalisation.\n",
        "- Deployment readiness.\n",
        "\n",
        "The evaluated images represent different captures under\n",
        "different illumination conditions, not exact transformations\n",
        "of the same source images. Therefore, observed displacement\n",
        "must not be attributed exclusively to illumination.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 7. Status\n",
        "\n",
        "Working title and research framing proposed.\n",
        "Final manuscript wording remains subject to evidence review."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dZucG4a38buu"
      }
    },
