            "EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 3.3.1\n",
            "MANUSCRIPT RESEARCH FRAMING\n",
            "========================================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "Working title:\n",
            "Reference-Relative Face Embedding Displacement Across Illumination Geometry Conditions: An Identity-Level Empirical Study\n",
            "\n",
            "Central research question:\n",
            "How does reference-relative FaceNet embedding displacement vary across illumination geometry conditions, and how consistently are these differences observed across individual identities?\n",
            "\n",
            "Supporting research questions:\n",
            "RQ1: How do Euclidean embedding displacement and cosine distance vary across near-frontal, oblique, and large-angular illumination conditions?\n",
            "RQ2: Are the differences between illumination geometry groups consistent across the evaluated identities?\n",
