            "EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 3.3.3\n",
            "CONTRIBUTIONS AND HYPOTHESES\n",
            "========================================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "Contributions: 4\n",
            "C1: Identity-level empirical characterisation of reference-relative FaceNet embedding displacement across illumination geometry conditions.\n",
            "C2: Comparative examination of Euclidean displacement and cosine distance relative to a common reference.\n",
            "C3: Repeated-measures statistical comparison of three illumination geometry groups.\n",
            "C4: Exploratory comparison of frontal and beyond-frontal illumination conditions.\n",
            "\n",
            "Hypotheses:\n",
            "H1 | RETROSPECTIVE_DIRECTIONAL\n",
            "H2 | RETROSPECTIVE_IDENTITY_CONSISTENCY\n",
