        "- Use 38 identities.\n",
        "- Use 2,414 source images.\n",
        "- Use 2,128 evaluation observations.\n",
        "- Use 56 non-reference evaluation conditions.\n",
        "- Use the actual Euclidean and cosine group means.\n",
        "- Report the six-test Holm correction.\n",
        "- Do not claim recognition accuracy or drift detection.\n",
        "- Do not attribute all observed displacement exclusively\n",
        "  to illumination.\n",
