        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.8.4\n",
        "## In-Text Citation Consistency Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Verify consistency between the consolidated introduction and the APA 7 reference list.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Required citation forms\n",
        "\n",
        "- Moses et al. (1994)\n",
        "- Beveridge et al. (2009)\n",
        "- Han et al. (2013)\n",
        "- Ochoa-Villegas et al. (2015)\n",
        "\n",
        "### Checks\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Replace outdated three-author narrative citation formatting.\n",
        "2. Identify all cited author-year combinations.\n",
        "3. Confirm every citation has a corresponding reference entry.\n",
        "4. Identify unused reference entries.\n",
        "5. Confirm the angular-grouping citation remains present.\n",
        "6. Preserve the existing introduction content apart from citation corrections.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Deliverables\n",
        "\n",
        "- Corrected consolidated introduction.\n",
        "- Citation consistency audit JSON.\n",
        "- Markdown and JSON reload verification."
      ],
