        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.8.8\n",
        "## Final APA 7 Citation Audit — Regex Correction\n",
        "\n",
        "The previous audit incorrectly detected the Han citation because its regular expression did not support the comma-separated author-year format used in parenthetical citations.\n",
        "\n",
        "The revised detector will recognise:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Narrative: Han et al. (2013)\n",
        "- Parenthetical: (Han et al., 2013)\n",
        "\n",
        "The same dual-format detection will be applied to all four references.\n",
        "\n",
        "No manuscript content will be changed.\n",
        "\n",
        "The audit will verify citation presence, reference coverage, the Han preprocessing context, and the unchanged manuscript checksum."
      ],
