        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.9.2\n",
        "## Methodology: Dataset and Acquisition Provenance\n",
        "\n",
        "This subsection documents the dataset source, acquisition procedure, image composition, condition coverage, integrity checks, and provenance limitations.\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset is the Cropped Extended Yale B frontal-pose illumination subset. It must not be described as the complete multi-pose Extended Yale B dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "The acquisition record identifies a community-hosted Academic Torrents listing as the source. The archive passed ZIP integrity testing and its SHA-256 checksum was recorded. However, the archive was not independently authenticated against an official UCSD checksum.\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset composition must distinguish all decoded PGM images, the standard-illumination images retained for analysis, the excluded ambient reference images, and the common-condition subset."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "z8HRQZ_wJpXc"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import re\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "BASE = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_20_Results\")\n",
        "STEP_DIR = BASE / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "OUTPUT_DIR = STEP_DIR / \"step_3392\"\n",
        "OUTPUT_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "section_title = \"3.2 Dataset and Acquisition Provenance\"\n",
        "\n",
        "section_text = \"\"\"\n",
        "The external evaluation dataset used in Experiment 20 was the Cropped Extended Yale B frontal-pose illumination subset. It contains cropped grayscale facial images captured under different illumination conditions for 38 identities. This subset should be distinguished from the complete multi-pose Extended Yale B dataset.\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset archive was acquired through a community-hosted Academic Torrents listing. The acquisition record identifies the source listing and records an archive size of 58,493,820 bytes. The downloaded ZIP archive passed its integrity test and contained 2,586 members. Its SHA-256 checksum was recorded as 8bbabf3836d077d60626c9ee3c54c2d2851a8d2c15c8b7e13b9bc162e86ea573. The archive provenance remains subject to an important limitation: it was not independently authenticated against an official UCSD checksum. Accordingly, the acquisition record and checksum provide traceability for the downloaded archive but do not establish official dataset authenticity.\n",
        "\n",
        "The archive contained 2,452 PGM image files, all of which were successfully decoded during the image-integrity audit. Filename and condition validation identified 2,414 standard-illumination images and 38 ambient reference images. The ambient images were excluded from the standard-illumination analysis. The retained standard-illumination images represented 64 distinct illumination conditions across the 38 identities. Seven identities did not contain every condition in the overall set.\n",
        "\n",
        "To support comparisons with complete identity coverage, the analysis used the 57 illumination conditions shared by all 38 identities. This common-condition subset comprised 2,166 identity-condition observations. The remaining conditions that were not shared by every identity were not included in analyses requiring complete identity-condition coverage. One observation per identity corresponded to the reference condition, A+000E+00; after its exclusion, 2,128 non-reference observations across 56 conditions formed the primary evaluation cohort.\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset was frozen for the Stage 2 analysis, with acquisition records, image-integrity results, condition manifests, embedding artifacts, and associated checksums retained in the project archive. These records support reproducibility and traceability of the analysed cohort. They do not remove the limitation arising from the community-hosted source or establish authentication against an official dataset checksum.\n",
        "\"\"\".strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Explicit facts from the acquisition and frozen dataset records.\n",
        "facts = {\n",
        "    \"dataset\": \"Cropped Extended Yale B\",\n",
        "    \"subset\": \"frontal-pose illumination subset\",\n",
        "    \"source\": \"Community-hosted Academic Torrents listing\",\n",
        "    \"archive_size_bytes\": 58493820,\n",
        "    \"zip_member_count\": 2586,\n",
        "    \"archive_sha256\": \"8bbabf3836d077d60626c9ee3c54c2d2851a8d2c15c8b7e13b9bc162e86ea573\",\n",
        "    \"total_pgm_files\": 2452,\n",
        "    \"successfully_decoded_pgm_files\": 2452,\n",
        "    \"standard_illumination_images\": 2414,\n",
        "    \"ambient_reference_images_excluded\": 38,\n",
        "    \"identities\": 38,\n",
        "    \"overall_illumination_conditions\": 64,\n",
        "    \"common_illumination_conditions\": 57,\n",
        "    \"common_condition_observations\": 2166,\n",
        "    \"incomplete_identities\": 7,\n",
        "    \"reference_condition\": \"A+000E+00\",\n",
        "    \"reference_observations\": 38,\n",
        "    \"evaluation_conditions\": 56,\n",
        "    \"evaluation_observations\": 2128,\n",
        "    \"official_ucsd_checksum_authenticated\": False\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "checks = {\n",
        "    \"correct_dataset_subset_named\":\n",
        "        \"Cropped Extended Yale B frontal-pose illumination subset\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"community_hosted_source_disclosed\":\n",
        "        \"community-hosted Academic Torrents listing\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"archive_size_correct\":\n",
        "        \"58,493,820 bytes\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"archive_member_count_correct\":\n",
        "        \"2,586 members\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"archive_sha256_correct\":\n",
        "        facts[\"archive_sha256\"] in section_text,\n",
        "    \"official_checksum_limitation_disclosed\":\n",
        "        \"not independently authenticated against an official UCSD checksum\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"all_decoded_pgm_files_reported\":\n",
        "        \"2,452 PGM image files, all of which were successfully decoded\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"standard_and_ambient_counts_distinguished\":\n",
        "        \"2,414 standard-illumination images and 38 ambient reference images\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"ambient_images_exclusion_stated\":\n",
        "        \"ambient images were excluded\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"overall_condition_count_correct\":\n",
        "        \"64 distinct illumination conditions\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"common_condition_count_correct\":\n",
        "        \"57 illumination conditions shared by all 38 identities\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"common_observation_count_correct\":\n",
        "        \"2,166 identity-condition observations\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"incomplete_identity_count_correct\":\n",
        "        \"Seven identities\" in section_text,\n",
        "    \"reference_and_evaluation_counts_correct\":\n",
