        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.9.11\n",
        "## Methodology: Limitations and Reproducibility\n",
        "\n",
        "This subsection consolidates the methodological limitations relevant to interpreting and reproducing the Stage 2 evaluation. It must distinguish documented experimental choices from unresolved reproducibility limitations and must not imply that the study validates recognition accuracy, operational drift detection, or generalisation across architectures."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Z-JsLfEqMlw4"
      }
    },
