        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.9.12\n",
        "## Methodological Correction: Cosine-Distance Definition\n",
        "\n",
        "The cosine-distance description in Step 3.3.9.7 requires technical clarification. Cosine distance is defined as one minus cosine similarity; it is not itself an angle measured in degrees or radians.\n",
        "\n",
        "Because the embeddings were L2-normalised, Euclidean distance and cosine distance are mathematically related. The manuscript should acknowledge this relationship when describing the two metrics."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xQNr1ZFcM0xR"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "import json\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
