            "\n",
            "9: Although the model architecture, pretrained training source, software versions, output dimensionality, and inference settings were recorded, the exact pretrained weight-file identity and its SHA256 checksum were not preserved. Consequently, the model configuration is documented at the architecture and pretrained-source level, but exact weight-file reproducibility cannot be independently established from the retained records.\n",
            "10: \n",
            "11: The resulting embeddings were retained with row-aligned image and identity metadata, including filenames, subject identifiers, illumination azimuths, elevations, and condition labels. These records enabled each non-reference embedding to be associated with the corresponding identity-specific reference representation during the displacement analysis.\n",
