ion and identity-conditioned monitoring.\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 2,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    \\\\\\\"expected_source_images\\\\\\\": 889,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"expected_identities\\\\\\\": 13,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\": 512,\\\\n\\\\n    \\\\\\\"transformation_families\\\\\\\": [\\\\n        \\\\\\\"illumination\\\\\\\",\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 8,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"experiment18_illumination_results\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"experiment18_facenet_lfw_embeddings\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"\\\\narchives = [\\\\n    base / \\\\\\\"experiment18_facenet_lfw_embeddings.npz\\\\\\\",\\\\n    base / \\\\\\\"experiment18_illumination_results.npz\\\\\\\"\\\\n]\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 75)\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 12,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"experiment18_illumination_results\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"archive_path = Path(\\\\n    \\\\\\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/\\\\\\\"\\\\n    \\\\\\\"experiment18_illumination_results.npz\\\\\\\"\\\\n)\\\\n\\\\nassert archive_path.exists(), \\\\\\\"Experiment 18 archive not found.\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 14,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"experiment18_illumination_results\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"archive_path = Path(\\\\n    \\\\\\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/\\\\\\\"\\\\n    \\\\\\\"experiment18_illumination_results.npz\\\\\\\"\\\\n)\\\\n\\\\nassert archive_path.exists(), \\\\\\\"Experiment 18 archive not found.\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 15,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"VGGFace2\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"- Identities: 13.\\\\n- Embedding dimension: 512.\\\\n- Embedding model: InceptionResnetV1.\\\\n- Pretrained weights: VGGFace2.\\\\n- Acquisition conditions: Original, low illumination and high illumination.\\\\n- Purpose: Develop and evaluate paired within-identity drift detection methods.\\\\n\\\\n- One identity accounts for 56.69% of the 889 paired observations.\\\\n- The existing cohort excludes 67 of 956 original evaluation positions because of extraction failures under at least one illumination condition.\\\\n- Extended Yale B is grayscale, whereas the existing pipeline uses an InceptionResnetV1 model pretrained on VGGFace2.\\\\n- Preprocessing compatibility and extraction success must be tested before Stage 2 is accepted.\\\\n- Cross-dataset validation does not automatically establish generalisation to unconstrained real-world biometric systems.\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 16,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"VGGFace2\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"        \\\\\\\"paired_observations\\\\\\\": 889,\\\\n        \\\\\\\"identities\\\\\\\": 13,\\\\n        \\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\": 512,\\\\n        \\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"pretrained_weights\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"VGGFace2\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"purpose\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Method development and calibration\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    \\\\\\\"stage_2\\\\\\\": {\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 18,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"Resize\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    \\\\\\\"expected_dimensions\\\\\\\": [168, 192],\\\\n    \\\\\\\"dimensions_note\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"Reported for manually aligned, cropped and resized images; \\\\\\\"\\\\n        \\\\\\\"must be confirmed against the acquired archive.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    )\\\\n}\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 41,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"alignment\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"Audit objectives:\\\\n1. Locate the Experiment 18 notebook in Google Drive.\\\\n2. Identify the InceptionResnetV1 model configuration.\\\\n3. Identify the pretrained weights.\\\\n4. Recover image resizing and normalization procedures.\\\\n5. Identify face detection, alignment, and cropping operations.\\\\n6. Identify embedding extraction and output dimensionality.\\\\n7. Inspect the current Colab package versions and GPU availability.\\\\n8. Save a reproducible compatibility audit.\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 42,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"VGGFace2\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"MTCNN\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"fixed_image_standardization\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"prewhiten\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"Resize\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"Normalize\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"interpolate\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"ToTensor\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"face_detection\\\",\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"\\\\nsearch_terms = [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"InceptionResnetV1\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"VGGFace2\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"MTCNN\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"fixed_image_standardization\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"prewhiten\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Resize\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Normalize\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"interpolate\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"160\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"512\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"eval()\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"no_grad\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"unsqueeze\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"ToTensor\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"face_detection\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"align\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"embedding\\\\\\\"\\\\n]\\\\nevidence_flags = {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"model_architecture_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"inceptionresnetv1\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    ),\\\\n    \\\\\\\"pretrained_weights_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"vggface2\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    \\\\\\\"face_detection_reference_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"mtcnn\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n        or \\\\\\\"face_detection\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    \\\\\\\"resize_reference_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"resize\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n        or \\\\\\\"interpolate\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    \\\\\\\"normalization_reference_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"fixed_image_standardization\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n        or \\\\\\\"prewhiten\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n        or \\\\\\\"normalize\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    \\\\\\\"embedding_dimension_reference_found\\\\\\\": (\\\\n        \\\\\\\"512\\\\\\\" in all_evidence_text\\\\n    )\\\\n}\\\"\\n\",\"        }\\n\",\"      ]\\n\",\"    },\\n\",\"    {\\n\",\"      \\\"path\\\": \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment 13/Experiment_13_Final.ipynb\\\",\\n\",\"      \\\"experiment18_reference\\\": false,\\n\",\"      \\\"evidence\\\": [\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 2,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    \\\\\\\"random_seed\\\\\\\": SEED,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"n_seeds\\\\\\\": 20,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\": 64,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"reference_samples\\\\\\\": 1000,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"calibration_windows\\\\\\\": 200,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"control_windows\\\\\\\": 500,\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 3,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    n_windows=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"reference_samples\\\\\\\"] // CONFIG[\\\\\\\"window_size\\\\\\\"],\\\\n    window_size=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"window_size\\\\\\\"],\\\\n    dimension=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"],\\\\n)\\\\n\\\\ncalibration = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n    n_windows=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"calibration_windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\ncontrol = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n    n_windows=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"control_windows\\\\\\\"],\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"Reference windows:\\\\\\\", reference.shape)\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 6,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"        n_windows=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"evaluation_windows_per_condition\\\\\\\"],\\\\n        window_size=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"window_size\\\\\\\"],\\\\n        dimension=CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"],\\\\n        mean_shift=shift,\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 8,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    # Independent datasets for this seed\\\\n    ref = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 50, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    )\\\\n    cal = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 200, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    ctrl = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 500, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n\\\\n    # Fit detectors using reference data only\\\\n                    500,\\\\n                    20,\\\\n                    CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"],\\\\n                    mean_shift=shift,\\\\n                )\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 9,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    # 1. Generate independent datasets for this seed\\\\n    ref = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 50, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    )\\\\n    cal = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 200, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    ctrl = generate_embedding_windows(\\\\n        seed_rng, 500, 20, CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"]\\\\n\\\\n    # 2. Fit detectors on the same reference data\\\\n            500,\\\\n            20,\\\\n            CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"],\\\\n            mean_shift=shift,\\\\n        )\\\\n        for shift in CONFIG[\\\\\\\"mean_shift_strengths\\\\\\\"]\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 18,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"embedding_dimension\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"else:\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"Required functions and configuration are available.\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"Embedding dimension:\\\\\\\", CONFIG[\\\\\\\"embedding_dimension\\\\\\\"])\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"Random seed:\\\\\\\", CONFIG[\\\\\\\"random_seed\\\\\\\"])\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"Detectors:\\\\\\\", CONFIG[\\\\\\\"detectors\\\\\\\"])\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 79,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"alignment\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nIndex-order check completed.\\\\\\\")\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"Note: hashes alone cannot establish alignment unless we also have\\\\\\\"\\\\n      \\\\\\\" matching source-image hashes from the original embedding run.\\\\\\\")\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 82,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"alignment\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"    \\\\\\\"Identity mismatch detected; do not generate transformed embeddings.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nIdentity alignment check passed.\\\\\\\")\\\"\\n\",\"        },\\n\",\"        {\\n\",\"          \\\"cell_index\\\": 89,\\n\",\"          \\\"matched_terms\\\": [\\n\",\"            \\\"alignment\\\"\\n\",\"          ],\\n\",\"          \\\"excerpt\\\": \\\"- The fresh identities come from the same dataset, not an external dataset.\\\\n- Matching identity labels verifies the selected identity mapping but does not\\\\n  independently prove exact image-level alignment for identities with multiple images.\\\\n- No biometric recognition accuracy, demographic fairness, bias mitigation, or\\\\n  deployment-readiness claim is supported.\\\\n- The detector's threshold and CUSUM settings are provisional and do not guarantee\\\"\\n\",\"        }\\n\",\"      ]\\n\",\"    }\\n\",\"  ],\\n\",\"  \\\"supporting_artifacts\\\": [\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/experiment18_facenet_lfw_embeddings.npz\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/experiment18_illumination_results.npz\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/illumination_identity_summary.csv\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/illumination_metadata.json\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/experiment18_final_research_evidence.md\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/experiment18_final_research_evidence.json\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_18_Results/Experiment_18_Final_Research_Package.zip\\\",\\n\",\"    \\\