        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Update the statistical-analysis methodology subsection with the verified bootstrap configuration.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Verified details\n",
        "- Bootstrap iterations: 20,000.\n",
        "- Random seed: 2026274.\n",
        "- Confidence interval: 95%.\n",
        "- Resampling unit: identity.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Required update\n",
        "The statistical-analysis subsection must explicitly report the bootstrap iteration count and random seed. It must retain the existing description of identity-level resampling and the combined six-comparison Holm correction.\n",
        "\n",
        "No statistical results will be recalculated. No existing result files will be modified."
