      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## Step 3.3.10.6 — Hemisphere-Based Results Verification\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "This step verifies the exploratory hemisphere-based analysis of reference-relative face embedding displacement under frontal and beyond-frontal illumination conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "The analysis examines whether embedding displacement differs between the two hemisphere categories across the 38 evaluated identities.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Verification procedure\n",
        "\n",
        "The audit performs the following checks:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Source-file verification:** Locates the frozen identity-level hemisphere means, hemisphere comparison results, and original hemisphere analysis audit.\n",
        "2. **Identity-level coverage:** Verifies the expected 76 identity-hemisphere records, representing 38 identities across two hemisphere categories.\n",
        "3. **Observation coverage:** Checks the documented frontal and beyond-frontal evaluation condition and observation counts.\n",
        "4. **Descriptive statistics:** Verifies the Euclidean displacement and cosine distance means for both hemisphere categories.\n",
        "5. **Paired comparisons:** Examines the mean paired differences between beyond-frontal and frontal conditions for both metrics.\n",
        "6. **Bootstrap confidence intervals:** Verifies the 95% confidence intervals, 20,000 bootstrap iterations, and random seed 2026275 against the original frozen audit.\n",
        "7. **Multiple-comparison correction:** Checks the two-test Holm-adjusted p-values and their statistical significance.\n",
        "8. **Integrity and persistence:** Calculates SHA256 hashes of the original source files and saves a separate JSON verification record.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Previously documented evaluation structure\n",
        "\n",
        "| Hemisphere category | Evaluation conditions | Observations |\n",
        "|---|---:|---:|\n",
        "| Frontal | 45 | 1,710 |\n",
        "| Beyond-frontal | 11 | 418 |\n",
        "| **Total** | **56** | **2,128** |\n",
        "\n",
        "The identity-level analysis contains 38 identities in each hemisphere category.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Previously reported results\n",
        "\n",
        "- Euclidean mean displacement: frontal 0.706220; beyond-frontal 1.287990.\n",
        "- Cosine mean distance: frontal 0.295816; beyond-frontal 0.838624.\n",
        "- Mean Euclidean paired difference: approximately 0.581770.\n",
        "- Mean cosine paired difference: approximately 0.542807.\n",
        "- Both comparisons were reported as statistically significant after Holm correction.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Interpretation and limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "This hemisphere-based analysis is exploratory.\n",
        "\n",
        "The frontal and beyond-frontal categories contain unequal numbers of illumination conditions. Hemisphere membership is also related to angular illumination geometry. Consequently, the observed differences cannot be interpreted as an isolated causal effect of hemisphere direction.\n",
        "\n",
        "The analysis describes reference-relative embedding displacement in the evaluated dataset and pretrained model. It does not establish biometric recognition accuracy, operational drift-detection performance, or deployment readiness.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Expected output\n",
        "\n",
        "`experiment20_step33106_hemisphere_results_verification.json`\n",
        "\n",
        "The verification record contains source-file hashes, identity coverage, descriptive statistics, paired comparison results, bootstrap evidence, individual checks, and the final audit status.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Preservation rule:** Original frozen experimental CSV files and existing statistical audit records must remain unchanged.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1Qa0ZOYGzSGe"
      }
    },
