        "\n",
        "# Step 3.3.12 — Manuscript-Level Integration\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Integrate the completed Experiment 20 manuscript sections into one structured Markdown manuscript.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Required manuscript structure\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Title\n",
        "2. Abstract\n",
        "3. Keywords\n",
        "4. Introduction\n",
        "5. Methodology\n",
        "6. Results\n",
        "7. Discussion\n",
        "8. References\n",
        "\n",
        "## Source documents\n",
        "\n",
        "- Research framing and working title: Step 3.3.1\n",
        "- Abstract draft: Step 3.3.4\n",
        "- Keywords: Step 3.3.5\n",
        "- Consolidated Introduction with APA 7 citations: Step 3.3.8.2\n",
        "- APA 7 reference list: Step 3.3.8.3\n",
        "- Ten completed Methodology subsections: Step 3.3.9\n",
        "- Results section: Step 3.3.10.8\n",
        "- Corrected Discussion section: Step 3.3.11\n",
        "\n",
        "## Integration requirements\n",
        "\n",
        "- Preserve the scientific meaning and numerical values of each source section.\n",
        "- Preserve the existing APA 7 citations and reference entries.\n",
        "- Preserve the Results tables and their Markdown formatting.\n",
        "- Preserve the eight Discussion subsections.\n",
        "- Use consistent section numbering.\n",
        "- Include the correct study title.\n",
        "- Do not introduce new experimental results.\n",
        "- Do not silently rewrite or replace the approved abstract.\n",
        "- Do not remove methodological limitations.\n",
        "- Do not select a target journal.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Cross-section checks\n",
        "\n",
        "Verify:\n",
        "\n",
        "- 38 identities.\n",
        "- 2,414 standard-illumination images.\n",
        "- 2,166 observations across 57 common conditions.\n",
        "- 2,128 non-reference evaluation observations across 56 conditions.\n",
        "- Illumination-group observation counts: 646, 418, and 1,064.\n",
        "- Six pairwise comparisons and the combined six-test Holm correction.\n",
        "- Consistent interpretation of Kendall's W.\n",
        "- Consistent relationship between Euclidean displacement and cosine distance.\n",
        "- Consistent limitations concerning image captures, dataset provenance, architecture coverage, and operational drift detection.\n",
        "- All in-text citations have corresponding reference-list entries.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Output\n",
        "\n",
        "Create:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. One integrated manuscript in Markdown.\n",
        "2. One JSON integration and verification record.\n",
        "3. A SHA256 hash for the integrated manuscript.\n",
        "\n",
        "The original source files must remain unchanged.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Completion condition:** All required sections must be present, source integrity must be verified, and cross-section consistency checks must pass before the integrated manuscript is treated as ready for final editorial review.\n"
      ],
