        "\n",
        "EXPERIMENT 20 — STEP 3.3.13\n",
        "\n",
        "FULL MANUSCRIPT SCIENTIFIC, STATISTICAL AND EDITORIAL CONSISTENCY REVIEW\n",
        "\n",
        "Objective:\n",
        "\n",
        "Conduct a comprehensive, evidence-based review of the complete integrated Experiment 20 manuscript to assess its scientific accuracy, statistical validity, methodological transparency, reproducibility, citation consistency, and editorial quality.\n",
        "\n",
        "Primary manuscript:\n",
        "step_3_3/step_3312/experiment20_integrated_manuscript_v1.md\n",
        "\n",
        "Reference evidence:\n",
        "step_2_7/final_freeze/\n",
        "step_3_1/\n",
        "step_3_2/\n",
        "step_3_3/\n",
        "\n",
        "Review requirements:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. TITLE AND ABSTRACT\n",
        "- Verify that the title accurately represents the research.\n",
        "- Check consistency between the abstract and the actual experimental design.\n",
        "- Verify dataset size, identity count, embedding dimensions, methods, statistical results, and conclusions.\n",
        "- Identify unsupported or exaggerated abstract claims.\n",
        "\n",
        "2. INTRODUCTION\n",
        "- Review background, literature context, research gap, motivation, research questions, objectives, and contributions.\n",
        "- Check whether the literature supports the claims made.\n",
        "- Ensure that the research gap is presented cautiously.\n",
        "- Do not claim established novelty.\n",
        "- Verify APA 7 in-text citation consistency.\n",
        "\n",
        "3. METHODOLOGY\n",
        "- Verify dataset acquisition and provenance.\n",
        "- Verify the cropped frontal-pose subset description.\n",
        "- Verify subject selection and illumination-condition coverage.\n",
        "- Check image preprocessing and grayscale-to-RGB channel replication.\n",
        "- Verify MTCNN pilot failure and the decision to use direct resizing.\n",
        "- Check FaceNet architecture, pretrained weights description, embedding dimensions, and software versions.\n",
        "- Verify embedding normalisation and reference-relative distance calculations.\n",
        "- Check illumination geometry classification and angular thresholds.\n",
