        "## Step 3.3.15 — Verification of Holm-Adjusted and Hemisphere Comparison Results\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Resolve the three outstanding numerical checks identified in Step 3.3.13 by examining the original frozen statistical result files.\n",
