        "1. Inspect all six paired-comparison records and their Holm-adjusted p-values.\n",
        "2. Inspect both hemisphere-comparison records.\n",
        "3. Identify the exact metric labels stored in the frozen CSV files.\n",
        "4. Compare the stored values with the values reported by the previous audit.\n",
        "5. Determine whether the outstanding hemisphere checks resulted from incorrect metric-label matching or an actual data discrepancy.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Data Integrity\n",
        "\n",
        "The original frozen CSV files are read-only evidence. This step must not recalculate, overwrite, or modify any experimental results.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Expected Output\n",
        "\n",
        "A complete inspection of the six paired comparisons, two hemisphere comparisons, their metric labels, adjusted p-values, confidence intervals, and bootstrap settings.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Completion Criteria\n",
        "\n",
        "Both statistical result files must be inspected successfully. Any discrepancy must be documented before manuscript corrections begin.\n"
