      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.22: Holm-Value Reference Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "Locate every occurrence of the frozen and corrected Holm-adjusted p-values across Experiment 20 project files.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Values to trace\n",
        "- Frozen value: 2.18278728426e-11\n",
        "- Correct combined-family value: 4.36557456851e-11\n",
        "\n",
        "## Scope\n",
        "Search the Experiment_20_Results directory recursively for Markdown, CSV, JSON, text, Python, and Jupyter Notebook files.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Procedure\n",
        "1. Search for scientific notation and decimal representations of both values.\n",
        "2. Record matching file paths, line numbers, and surrounding text.\n",
        "3. Record SHA256 hashes of scanned files.\n",
        "4. Identify files containing either value.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Integrity restrictions\n",
        "- Read-only search.\n",
        "- Do not edit manuscripts, tables, CSVs, JSON files, or notebooks.\n",
        "- Save a new audit report under Step 3.3.22.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Interpretation\n",
        "This audit identifies where corrections may be needed. It does not automatically modify any file or establish that every occurrence is an error."
