        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.31: Integrated Manuscript Integrity Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "Validate the new manuscript version after figure integration.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Checks\n",
        "1. Confirm all four relative image paths resolve to existing files.\n",
        "2. Verify each embedded image against its frozen SHA256.\n",
        "3. Confirm all four captions and in-text references are present.\n",
        "4. Confirm Figures 1–2 follow Table 1.\n",
        "5. Confirm Figures 3–4 follow the two hemisphere-result paragraphs and precede the exploratory limitation.\n",
        "6. Compare Table 1 and Table 2 against the original manuscript.\n",
        "7. Confirm all original section headings remain present.\n",
        "8. Confirm the original manuscript and frozen figures remain unchanged.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Integrity restrictions\n",
        "- Read-only audit.\n",
        "- Do not edit the new manuscript.\n",
        "- Do not modify original manuscripts, figures, or statistical evidence.\n",
        "- Save a new audit report only.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "A complete structural and integrity validation of manuscript v2."
      ],
