        "# Experiment 20 — Step 3.3.33: Corrected Hemisphere Figure Placement Verification\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "Revalidate Section 3.5 using exact line-based matching rather than broad regular expressions.\n",
        "\n",
