        "1. Euclidean result paragraph.\n",
        "2. Cosine result paragraph.\n",
        "3. Figure 3 image embed.\n",
        "4. Figure 3 caption.\n",
        "5. Figure 4 image embed.\n",
        "6. Figure 4 caption.\n",
        "7. Exploratory limitation paragraph.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Additional checks\n",
        "- Confirm both result paragraphs contain their correct figure references.\n",
        "- Confirm all image paths exist.\n",
        "- Confirm image hashes match the frozen figures.\n",
        "- Confirm manuscript v2 remains unchanged.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Integrity restrictions\n",
        "- Read-only inspection.\n",
        "- Do not edit manuscript v2.\n",
        "- Do not modify frozen figures or statistical evidence.\n",
        "- Save a new verification report.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "A definitive pass or failure based on the actual Section 3.5 sequence."
