      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## Phase 4.1 — Dataset and Cohort Reproducibility Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Verify the dataset composition, identity cohort, illumination-condition coverage, reference observations, and evaluation observations reported in Experiment 20.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Frozen study figures to verify\n",
        "\n",
        "- 38 identities.\n",
        "- 2,414 standard illumination images.\n",
        "- 38 ambient images excluded.\n",
        "- 2,166 observations across 57 common conditions.\n",
        "- 2,128 evaluation observations across 56 non-reference conditions.\n",
        "- 38 reference observations, one per identity.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Audit scope\n",
        "\n",
        "The audit will:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Locate relevant dataset directories and metadata files.\n",
        "2. Inspect available CSV manifests and dataset metadata.\n",
        "3. Identify identity, illumination-condition, and reference/evaluation fields where available.\n",
        "4. Compare observed counts against the frozen manuscript figures.\n",
        "5. Record missing evidence and discrepancies without attempting to repair them.\n",
        "6. Verify that the manuscript remains unchanged.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is a read-only audit of existing material. It will not regenerate embeddings, modify original images, change cohort membership, or overwrite frozen experimental evidence.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Completion criterion\n",
        "\n",
        "Every reported cohort count must be traceable to an identifiable dataset file, manifest, or frozen analysis artifact. Any figure that cannot be independently traced must be explicitly marked for further review.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "CvU5HaKGQf3T"
      }
