            "  \"subsection\": \"3.2 Dataset and Acquisition Provenance\",\n",
            "  \"created_utc\": \"2026-11-11T10:34:01.859266+00:00\",\n",
            "  \"draft_text\": \"The external evaluation dataset used in Experiment 20 was the Cropped Extended Yale B frontal-pose illumination subset. It contains cropped grayscale facial images captured under different illumination conditions for 38 identities. This subset should be distinguished from the complete multi-pose Extended Yale B dataset.\\n\\nThe dataset archive was acquired through a community-hosted Academic Torrents listing. The acquisition record identifies the source listing and records an archive size of 58,493...[truncated]\",\n",
