      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "## Phase 4.2 — Experimental Pipeline Reproducibility Audit\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Verify the reproducibility and internal consistency of the Experiment 20 image-preprocessing and face-embedding generation pipeline.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Pipeline configuration to verify\n",
        "\n",
        "- Model architecture: InceptionResnetV1.\n",
        "- Pretrained weights: VGGFace2.\n",
        "- Embedding dimension: 512.\n",
        "- Source image mode: grayscale.\n",
        "- Image conversion: grayscale to RGB.\n",
        "- Image resizing: 160 × 160 pixels.\n",
        "- Tensor conversion: torchvision.transforms.ToTensor.\n",
        "- Input range: [0, 1].\n",
        "- Face detection: disabled.\n",
        "- Face alignment: disabled.\n",
        "- Ambient images: excluded.\n",
        "- Expected standard images: 2,414.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Audit scope\n",
        "\n",
        "The audit will inspect the existing embedding metadata, generation configuration, checkpoint metadata, preprocessing audit and embedding archive.\n",
        "\n",
        "It will verify:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Whether configuration values agree across the available records.\n",
        "2. Whether the reported processing and embedding counts are consistent.\n",
        "3. Whether the embedding archive exists and has the expected structure.\n",
        "4. Whether the stored embeddings have the expected dimensionality and finite numerical values.\n",
        "5. Whether the embedding vectors satisfy the documented normalisation requirements, if applicable.\n",
        "6. Whether the existing evidence supports reproducibility of the recorded pipeline.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Audit boundaries\n",
        "\n",
        "- No embeddings will be regenerated.\n",
        "- No model weights will be changed.\n",
        "- No preprocessing will be rerun.\n",
        "- No source metadata or frozen evidence will be overwritten.\n",
        "- Any missing or inconsistent evidence will be reported rather than silently repaired.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Completion criterion\n",
        "\n",
        "The recorded configuration, embedding metadata and stored embedding artifact must be internally consistent. Any limitation preventing independent reproduction must be documented.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Q1KEirUWRLCa"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "import os\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import hashlib\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "# EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 4.2\n",
        "# EXPERIMENTAL PIPELINE REPRODUCIBILITY AUDIT\n",
        "#\n",
        "# READ-ONLY SOURCE INSPECTION\n",
        "# Writes one new audit report.\n",
        "# Does not regenerate embeddings or alter model files.\n",
        "# ============================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "BASE = Path(\n",
        "    \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Experiment_20_Results\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "MANUSCRIPT = (\n",
        "    BASE / \"step_3_3\" / \"step_3330\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_integrated_manuscript_v2.md\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "EMBEDDING_METADATA = (\n",
        "    BASE / \"embeddings\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_croppedyale_embedding_metadata.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "CHECKPOINT_METADATA = (\n",
        "    BASE / \"embeddings\" / \"checkpoints\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_embedding_checkpoint_metadata.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE = (\n",
        "    BASE / \"embeddings\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_croppedyale_facenet_embeddings.npz\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "FROZEN_BUNDLE = (\n",
        "    BASE / \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Frozen_Dataset\" /\n",
        "    \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Frozen_Dataset\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "CONFIGURATION = (\n",
        "    FROZEN_BUNDLE / \"configuration\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_embedding_generation_config.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PREPROCESSING_AUDIT = (\n",
        "    FROZEN_BUNDLE / \"audits\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_preprocessing_consistency_audit.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "QUALITY_AUDIT = (\n",
        "    FROZEN_BUNDLE / \"audits\" /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_embedding_quality_completeness_audit.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "OUTPUT_DIR = BASE / \"step_4_2_pipeline_reproducibility\"\n",
        "\n",
        "REPORT_PATH = (\n",
        "    OUTPUT_DIR /\n",
        "    \"experiment20_phase42_pipeline_reproducibility_audit.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "EXPECTED_MANUSCRIPT_HASH = (\n",
        "    \"2cc4156af63987fae717c37e997e6478e4253d81f584854fb5fab9f18da5e752\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "EXPECTED = {\n",
        "    \"model_architecture\": \"InceptionResnetV1\",\n",
        "    \"pretrained_weights\": \"VGGFace2\",\n",
        "    \"embedding_dimension\": 512,\n",
        "    \"source_image_mode\": \"L\",\n",
        "    \"conversion\": \"PIL.Image.convert('RGB')\",\n",
        "    \"resize\": [160, 160],\n",
        "    \"tensor_conversion\": \"torchvision.transforms.ToTensor\",\n",
        "    \"input_range\": [0.0, 1.0],\n",
        "    \"face_detection\": False,\n",
        "    \"face_alignment\": False,\n",
        "    \"ambient_images_included\": False,\n",
        "    \"expected_standard_images\": 2414,\n",
        "    \"processed_images\": 2414,\n",
        "    \"successful_embeddings\": 2414,\n",
        "    \"extraction_failures\": 0,\n",
        "    \"unique_subjects\": 38,\n",
        "    \"unique_illumination_conditions\": 64\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "OUTPUT_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. Utility functions\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "def sha256_file(path):\n",
        "    h = hashlib.sha256()\n",
        "\n",
        "    with open(path, \"rb\") as f:\n",
        "        for chunk in iter(\n",
        "            lambda: f.read(1024 * 1024),\n",
        "            b\"\"\n",
        "        ):\n",
        "            h.update(chunk)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return h.hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def load_json(path):\n",
        "    if not path.is_file():\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n",
        "        return json.load(f)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def find_nested(data, target_key):\n",
        "    \"\"\"Find all occurrences of a key in nested JSON.\"\"\"\n",
        "    found = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    if isinstance(data, dict):\n",
        "        for key, value in data.items():\n",
        "            if key == target_key:\n",
        "                found.append(value)\n",
        "\n",
        "            found.extend(find_nested(value, target_key))\n",
        "\n",
        "    elif isinstance(data, list):\n",
        "        for value in data:\n",
        "            found.extend(find_nested(value, target_key))\n",
        "\n",
        "    return found\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. Manuscript integrity\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 100)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 4.2\")\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENTAL PIPELINE REPRODUCIBILITY AUDIT\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 100)\n",
        "\n",
        "if not MANUSCRIPT.is_file():\n",
        "    raise FileNotFoundError(MANUSCRIPT)\n",
        "\n",
        "manuscript_hash = sha256_file(MANUSCRIPT)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n1. MANUSCRIPT INTEGRITY\")\n",
        "print(\"SHA256:\", manuscript_hash)\n",
        "print(\n",
        "    \"Matches frozen V2:\",\n",
        "    manuscript_hash == EXPECTED_MANUSCRIPT_HASH\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. Load pipeline records\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n2. PIPELINE METADATA DISCOVERY\")\n",
        "\n",
        "paths = {\n",
        "    \"embedding_metadata\": EMBEDDING_METADATA,\n",
        "    \"checkpoint_metadata\": CHECKPOINT_METADATA,\n",
        "    \"configuration\": CONFIGURATION,\n",
        "    \"preprocessing_audit\": PREPROCESSING_AUDIT,\n",
        "    \"embedding_quality_audit\": QUALITY_AUDIT\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "records = {}\n",
        "file_hashes = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "for name, path in paths.items():\n",
        "    print(\"\\n\", name)\n",
        "    print(\"Path:\", path)\n",
        "    print(\"Exists:\", path.is_file())\n",
        "\n",
        "    if path.is_file():\n",
        "        records[name] = load_json(path)\n",
        "        file_hashes[name] = sha256_file(path)\n",
        "        print(\"SHA256:\", file_hashes[name])\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        records[name] = None\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. Extract embedding configuration and counts\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "metadata = records[\"embedding_metadata\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "if metadata is None:\n",
        "    raise FileNotFoundError(\n",
        "        \"Embedding metadata is missing. Cannot continue.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "metadata_configuration = metadata.get(\n",
        "    \"configuration\", {}\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "metadata_counts = metadata.get(\n",
        "    \"counts\", {}\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n3. EMBEDDING METADATA CONFIGURATION\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 100)\n",
        "\n",
        "for key, expected_value in EXPECTED.items():\n",
        "    if key in metadata_configuration:\n",
        "        actual = metadata_configuration[key]\n",
        "    elif key in metadata_counts:\n",
        "        actual = metadata_counts[key]\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        actual = None\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\n",
        "        key,\n",
        "        \"| expected:\", expected_value,\n",
        "        \"| recorded:\", actual\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 5. Configuration comparison\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n4. CONFIGURATION CONSISTENCY\")\n",
        "\n",
        "config = records[\"configuration\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "configuration_comparisons = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "if config is not None:\n",
        "    print(json.dumps(config, indent=2)[:10000])\n",
        "\n",
        "    for key, expected_value in EXPECTED.items():\n",
        "        values = find_nested(config, key)\n",
        "\n",
        "        if values:\n",
        "            matched = any(\n",
        "                value == expected_value\n",
        "                for value in values\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            configuration_comparisons[key] = {\n",
        "                \"expected\": expected_value,\n",
        "                \"recorded_values\": values[:10],\n",
        "                \"match\": matched\n",
        "            }\n",
        "\n",
        "            print(\n",
        "                (\"PASS\" if matched else \"REVIEW\"),\n",
        "                key,\n",
        "                values[:5]\n",
        "            )\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            configuration_comparisons[key] = {\n",
        "                \"expected\": expected_value,\n",
        "                \"recorded_values\": [],\n",
        "                \"match\": None\n",
        "            }\n",
        "\n",
        "            print(\"NOT FOUND:\", key)\n",
        "\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"REVIEW: Configuration JSON is unavailable.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 6. Compare recorded embedding counts\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n5. EMBEDDING COUNT VERIFICATION\")\n",
        "\n",
        "count_comparisons = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "for key in [\n",
        "    \"expected_standard_images\",\n",
        "    \"processed_images\",\n",
        "    \"successful_embeddings\",\n",
        "    \"extraction_failures\",\n",
        "    \"unique_subjects\",\n",
        "    \"unique_illumination_conditions\"\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    actual = metadata_counts.get(key)\n",
        "    expected = EXPECTED[key]\n",
        "\n",
        "    matched = actual == expected\n",
        "\n",
        "    count_comparisons[key] = {\n",
        "        \"expected\": expected,\n",
        "        \"recorded\": actual,\n",
        "        \"match\": matched\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\n",
        "        (\"PASS\" if matched else \"REVIEW\"),\n",
        "        key,\n",
        "        \"| expected:\", expected,\n",
        "        \"| recorded:\", actual\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 7. Inspect checkpoint metadata\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n6. CHECKPOINT METADATA\")\n",
        "\n",
        "checkpoint = records[\"checkpoint_metadata\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "if checkpoint is not None:\n",
        "    print(json.dumps(checkpoint, indent=2)[:12000])\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"REVIEW: Checkpoint metadata unavailable.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 8. Inspect preprocessing and quality audit records\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n7. PREPROCESSING CONSISTENCY AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "preprocessing = records[\"preprocessing_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "if preprocessing is not None:\n",
        "    print(json.dumps(preprocessing, indent=2)[:12000])\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"REVIEW: Preprocessing audit unavailable.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n8. EMBEDDING QUALITY COMPLETENESS AUDIT\")\n",
        "\n",
        "quality = records[\"embedding_quality_audit\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "if quality is not None:\n",
        "    print(json.dumps(quality, indent=2)[:12000])\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"REVIEW: Embedding quality audit unavailable.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 9. Inspect embedding archive\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n9. EMBEDDING ARCHIVE INSPECTION\")\n",
        "\n",
        "archive_report = {\n",
        "    \"exists\": EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE.is_file(),\n",
        "    \"sha256\": None,\n",
        "    \"file_size_bytes\": None,\n",
        "    \"arrays\": {},\n",
        "    \"errors\": []\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "if EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE.is_file():\n",
        "    archive_report[\"sha256\"] = sha256_file(\n",
        "        EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    archive_report[\"file_size_bytes\"] = (\n",
        "        EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE.stat().st_size\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(\"Archive:\", EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE)\n",
        "    print(\"SHA256:\", archive_report[\"sha256\"])\n",
        "    print(\"Size bytes:\", archive_report[\"file_size_bytes\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with np.load(\n",
        "            EMBEDDING_ARCHIVE,\n",
        "            allow_pickle=False\n",
        "        ) as archive:\n",
        "\n",
        "            print(\"Archive keys:\", archive.files)\n",
        "\n",
        "            for key in archive.files:\n",
        "                array = archive[key]\n",
        "\n",
        "                item = {\n",
        "                    \"shape\": list(array.shape),\n",
        "                    \"dtype\": str(array.dtype),\n",
        "                    \"finite\": bool(\n",
        "                        np.isfinite(array).all()\n",
        "                    ) if np.issubdtype(\n",
        "                        array.dtype, np.number\n",
        "                    ) else None\n",
        "                }\n",
        "\n",
        "                if (\n",
        "                    np.issubdtype(array.dtype, np.number)\n",
        "                    and array.ndim >= 1\n",
        "                    and array.size > 0\n",
        "                ):\n",
        "                    item[\"minimum\"] = float(\n",
        "                        np.min(array)\n",
        "                    )\n",
        "                    item[\"maximum\"] = float(\n",
        "                        np.max(array)\n",
        "                    )\n",
        "\n",
        "                    if (\n",
        "                        array.ndim == 2\n",
        "                        and array.shape[1] == 512\n",
        "                    ):\n",
        "                        norms = np.linalg.norm(\n",
        "                            array.astype(np.float64),\n",
        "                            axis=1\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                        item[\"row_count\"] = int(\n",
        "                            array.shape[0]\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                        item[\"embedding_dimension\"] = int(\n",
        "                            array.shape[1]\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                        item[\"row_norm_minimum\"] = float(\n",
        "                            norms.min()\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                        item[\"row_norm_maximum\"] = float(\n",
        "                            norms.max()\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                        item[\"approximately_l2_normalised\"] = (\n",
        "                            bool(\n",
        "                                np.allclose(\n",
        "                                    norms,\n",
        "                                    1.0,\n",
        "                                    atol=1e-4\n",
        "                                )\n",
        "                            )\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "\n",
        "                archive_report[\"arrays\"][key] = item\n",
        "\n",
        "                print(\"\\nArray:\", key)\n",
        "                print(json.dumps(item, indent=2))\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as error:\n",
        "        archive_report[\"errors\"].append(str(error))\n",
        "        print(\"ARCHIVE INSPECTION ERROR:\", error)\n",
        "\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(\"REVIEW: Embedding archive not found.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 10. Build report\n",
        "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n10. AUDIT FINDINGS\")\n",
        "\n",
        "findings = []\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"manuscript_integrity\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"PASS\"\n",
        "        if manuscript_hash == EXPECTED_MANUSCRIPT_HASH\n",
        "        else \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"embedding_metadata\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"FOUND\"\n",
        "        if metadata is not None\n",
        "        else \"MISSING\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"configuration_metadata\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"FOUND\"\n",
        "        if config is not None\n",
        "        else \"MISSING\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"embedding_archive\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"FOUND\"\n",
        "        if archive_report[\"exists\"]\n",
        "        else \"MISSING\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"embedding_count_consistency\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"PASS\"\n",
        "        if all(\n",
        "            item[\"match\"]\n",
        "            for item in count_comparisons.values()\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        else \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "findings.append({\n",
        "    \"check\": \"configuration_comparison\",\n",
        "    \"status\": (\n",
        "        \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n",
        "        if any(\n",
        "            item[\"match\"] is False\n",
        "            or item[\"match\"] is None\n",
        "            for item in configuration_comparisons.values()\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        else \"CONSISTENT\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "report = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": \"Experiment 20\",\n",
        "    \"phase\": \"4.2\",\n",
        "    \"title\": \"Experimental Pipeline Reproducibility Audit\",\n",
        "    \"timestamp_utc\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),\n",
        "    \"manuscript_sha256\": manuscript_hash,\n",
        "    \"manuscript_matches_frozen_v2\": (\n",
        "        manuscript_hash == EXPECTED_MANUSCRIPT_HASH\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"expected_configuration\": EXPECTED,\n",
        "    \"metadata_file_hashes\": file_hashes,\n",
        "    \"configuration_comparisons\": configuration_comparisons,\n",
        "    \"embedding_count_comparisons\": count_comparisons,\n",
        "    \"checkpoint_metadata\": checkpoint,\n",
        "    \"preprocessing_audit\": preprocessing,\n",
        "    \"embedding_quality_audit\": quality,\n",
        "    \"embedding_archive_inspection\": archive_report,\n",
        "    \"findings\": findings,\n",
        "    \"source_files_modified\": False,\n",
        "    \"embeddings_regenerated\": False\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(REPORT_PATH, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n",
        "    json.dump(report, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 100)\n",
        "print(\"PHASE 4.2 AUDIT SUMMARY\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 100)\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in findings:\n",
        "    print(item[\"check\"], \":\", item[\"status\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nReport:\", REPORT_PATH)\n",
        "print(\"Report SHA256:\", sha256_file(REPORT_PATH))\n",
        "print(\"Manuscript unchanged:\", manuscript_hash == EXPECTED_MANUSCRIPT_HASH)\n",
        "print(\"Embeddings regenerated: False\")\n",
        "print(\"Source files modified: False\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\n",
        "    \"\\nSTATUS: \"\n",
        "    \"PIPELINE_REPRODUCIBILITY_AUDIT_COMPLETED_PENDING_REVIEW\"\n",
        ")\n"
      ],
