            "TOPIC: metric_dependence\n",
            "Matching lines: 46\n",
            "[L12] was established for each identity, and 2,128 evaluation observations\n",
            "[L13] across 56 non-reference illumination conditions were analysed using\n",
            "[L14] 512-dimensional embeddings. Euclidean displacement and cosine\n",
            "[L15] distance were calculated relative to the corresponding identity\n",
            "[L16] reference. Illumination conditions were grouped into near-frontal,\n",
            "[L18] \n",
            "[L19] Both distance measures exhibited progressively greater displacement\n",
            "[L20] across the three illumination groups. Mean Euclidean displacement\n",
            "[L21] increased from 0.402 in near-frontal conditions to 0.709 in oblique\n",
            "[L22] conditions and 1.118 in large-angular conditions. Corresponding mean\n",
            "[L23] cosine distances increased from 0.087 to 0.262 and 0.649. Friedman\n",
            "[L24] tests indicated significant differences across groups for both\n",
