            "Line 297: In the exploratory hemisphere analysis, mean Euclidean displacement was 0.706220 under frontal conditions and 1.287990 under beyond-frontal conditions. The mean paired difference (beyond-frontal minus frontal) was 0.581770 (95% bootstrap CI: [0.561986, 0.601954]; Holm-adjusted p = 1.455e-11). (Figure 3).\n",
            "Line 299: For cosine distance, the corresponding means were 0.295816 and 0.838624. The mean paired difference was 0.542807 (95% bootstrap CI: [0.516419, 0.568516]; Holm-adjusted p = 1.455e-11). (Figure 4).\n",
