      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# Phase 5.2 — Reproducibility and Integrity Review\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Conduct a consolidated, read-only reproducibility and integrity review of Experiment 20. This review verifies the integrity and traceability of the principal research artifacts, frozen dataset, embedding outputs, experiment notebook, and existing audit records.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Scope\n",
        "\n",
        "The review covers:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Experiment 20 notebook integrity and JSON validity.\n",
        "2. Frozen dataset archive integrity.\n",
        "3. Frozen dataset SHA-256 manifest verification.\n",
        "4. Embedding output and checkpoint consistency.\n",
        "5. Stage 2 freeze manifest presence and integrity.\n",
        "6. Existing Phase 5.2 audit records.\n",
        "7. A project-scoped inventory of relevant Experiment 20 artifacts.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Verification principles\n",
        "\n",
        "- Existing research artifacts will not be modified.\n",
        "- Existing audit records will not be overwritten.\n",
        "- SHA-256 hashes will be used to verify file integrity.\n",
        "- The frozen dataset archive will be tested for ZIP corruption.\n",
        "- Dataset files will be checked against the available SHA-256 manifest.\n",
        "- Matching embedding and checkpoint files will be compared using their SHA-256 hashes.\n",
        "- Missing files, inaccessible files, ambiguous manifest entries, and failed checks will be reported explicitly.\n",
        "- The review will distinguish verified results from unresolved limitations.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "A matching checksum establishes file consistency, not scientific validity. This audit does not independently establish biometric recognition accuracy, fairness, causal effects, deployment readiness, or generalisation beyond the evaluated dataset and experimental conditions.\n",
        "\n",
        "The initial broad inventory included unrelated files from the Colab environment. This consolidated review therefore focuses on the Experiment 20 project directory and its principal research artifacts.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "\n",
        "The audit will produce a structured verification report containing:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Artifact inventory and SHA-256 hashes.\n",
        "- Notebook and archive integrity results.\n",
        "- Dataset manifest verification results.\n",
        "- Embedding/checkpoint comparison.\n",
        "- Existing audit-record inventory.\n",
        "- PASS, FAIL, or REVIEW findings.\n",
        "- A final audit summary in JSON and Markdown formats.\n",
        "\n",
        "No existing research artifact will be replaced or deleted.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MpbcRADPp8yS"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.2\n",
        "# CONSOLIDATED REPRODUCIBILITY AND INTEGRITY REVIEW\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# This is a read-only verification of existing research artifacts.\n",
        "# It does not modify or delete existing project files.\n",
        "# It creates two new timestamped audit reports.\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "import os\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import csv\n",
        "import hashlib\n",
        "import zipfile\n",
        "import platform\n",
        "import sys\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. CONFIGURATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "DRIVE_ROOT = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive\")\n",
        "\n",
        "RESULTS_ROOT = DRIVE_ROOT / \"Experiment_20_Results\"\n",
        "\n",
        "NOTEBOOK_PATH = (\n",
        "    DRIVE_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"Colab Notebooks\"\n",
        "    / \"Experiment 20: Paired Identity-Level Evaluation of Within-Identity \"\n",
        "      \"Embedding Drift Detection Under Multiple Controlled Biometric \"\n",
        "      \"Acquisition Changes.ipynb\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "FROZEN_ZIP = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Frozen_Dataset.zip\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "EMBEDDING_PATH = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"embeddings\"\n",
        "    / \"experiment20_croppedyale_facenet_embeddings.npz\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "CHECKPOINT_PATH = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"embeddings\"\n",
        "    / \"checkpoints\"\n",
        "    / \"experiment20_embedding_checkpoint.npz\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "FREEZE_MANIFEST_PATH = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Freeze_Manifest.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE52_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"step_5_2_reproducibility_integrity_review\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE52_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "TIMESTAMP = datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ\")\n",
        "TIMESTAMP_ISO = datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. AUDIT STRUCTURES\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "checks = []\n",
        "artifact_inventory = []\n",
        "manifest_results = []\n",
        "\n",
        "def record_check(name, status, details):\n",
        "    checks.append({\n",
        "        \"check\": name,\n",
        "        \"status\": status,\n",
        "        \"details\": str(details)\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "def sha256_file(path, chunk_size=1024 * 1024):\n",
        "    digest = hashlib.sha256()\n",
        "    with open(path, \"rb\") as file:\n",
        "        while True:\n",
        "            chunk = file.read(chunk_size)\n",
        "            if not chunk:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "            digest.update(chunk)\n",
        "    return digest.hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "def inventory_file(path, category):\n",
        "    path = Path(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "    if not path.exists():\n",
        "        artifact_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"category\": category,\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"exists\": False,\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": None,\n",
        "            \"sha256\": None\n",
        "        })\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    if not path.is_file():\n",
        "        artifact_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"category\": category,\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"exists\": True,\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": None,\n",
        "            \"sha256\": None,\n",
        "            \"note\": \"Path exists but is not a regular file.\"\n",
        "        })\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        digest = sha256_file(path)\n",
        "        size = path.stat().st_size\n",
        "\n",
        "        artifact_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"category\": category,\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"exists\": True,\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": size,\n",
        "            \"sha256\": digest\n",
        "        })\n",
        "\n",
        "        return digest\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        artifact_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"category\": category,\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"exists\": True,\n",
        "            \"error\": repr(exc)\n",
        "        })\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.2 INTEGRITY REVIEW\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"Timestamp UTC:\", TIMESTAMP_ISO)\n",
        "print(\"Python:\", sys.version)\n",
        "print(\"Platform:\", platform.platform())\n",
        "print(\"Results directory:\", RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. PROJECT DIRECTORY AND NOTEBOOK VERIFICATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "if RESULTS_ROOT.is_dir():\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment 20 results directory\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Found: {RESULTS_ROOT}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment 20 results directory\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Missing: {RESULTS_ROOT}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "notebook_hash = inventory_file(NOTEBOOK_PATH, \"experiment_notebook\")\n",
        "\n",
        "if notebook_hash:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with open(NOTEBOOK_PATH, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "            notebook_data = json.load(file)\n",
        "\n",
        "        notebook_cells = notebook_data.get(\"cells\", [])\n",
        "        cell_types = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "        for cell in notebook_cells:\n",
        "            cell_type = cell.get(\"cell_type\", \"unknown\")\n",
        "            cell_types[cell_type] = cell_types.get(cell_type, 0) + 1\n",
        "\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Experiment 20 notebook JSON validity\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Valid notebook JSON; cells={len(notebook_cells)}; \"\n",
        "            f\"cell types={cell_types}; SHA256={notebook_hash}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Experiment 20 notebook JSON validity\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment 20 notebook availability\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Notebook not found or unreadable: {NOTEBOOK_PATH}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. FROZEN DATASET ARCHIVE VERIFICATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "zip_manifest_names = []\n",
        "zip_members = []\n",
        "zip_member_hashes = {}\n",
        "\n",
        "if FROZEN_ZIP.is_file():\n",
        "    zip_hash = inventory_file(FROZEN_ZIP, \"frozen_dataset_archive\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with zipfile.ZipFile(FROZEN_ZIP, \"r\") as archive:\n",
        "            bad_member = archive.testzip()\n",
        "            zip_members = archive.namelist()\n",
        "\n",
        "            if bad_member is None:\n",
        "                record_check(\n",
        "                    \"Frozen dataset ZIP integrity\",\n",
        "                    \"PASS\",\n",
        "                    f\"ZIP test passed; members={len(zip_members)}; \"\n",
        "                    f\"archive SHA256={zip_hash}\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                record_check(\n",
        "                    \"Frozen dataset ZIP integrity\",\n",
        "                    \"FAIL\",\n",
        "                    f\"Corrupt ZIP member: {bad_member}\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "\n",
        "            zip_manifest_names = [\n",
        "                name for name in zip_members\n",
        "                if Path(name).name.lower() == \"sha256sums.txt\"\n",
        "            ]\n",
        "\n",
        "            if len(zip_manifest_names) == 1:\n",
        "                record_check(\n",
        "                    \"Frozen dataset manifest discovery\",\n",
        "                    \"PASS\",\n",
        "                    f\"Found one manifest: {zip_manifest_names[0]}\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "            elif len(zip_manifest_names) == 0:\n",
        "                record_check(\n",
        "                    \"Frozen dataset manifest discovery\",\n",
        "                    \"FAIL\",\n",
        "                    \"No SHA256SUMS.txt file found inside the archive.\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "            else:\n",
        "                record_check(\n",
        "                    \"Frozen dataset manifest discovery\",\n",
        "                    \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "                    f\"Multiple manifests found: {zip_manifest_names}\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Frozen dataset ZIP integrity\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Frozen dataset archive availability\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Missing archive: {FROZEN_ZIP}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 5. SHA-256 MANIFEST VERIFICATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "if len(zip_manifest_names) == 1:\n",
        "    manifest_name = zip_manifest_names[0]\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with zipfile.ZipFile(FROZEN_ZIP, \"r\") as archive:\n",
        "            manifest_bytes = archive.read(manifest_name)\n",
        "\n",
        "        manifest_text = manifest_bytes.decode(\"utf-8-sig\")\n",
        "        manifest_lines = manifest_text.splitlines()\n",
        "\n",
        "        expected_entries = []\n",
        "\n",
        "        for line_number, line in enumerate(manifest_lines, start=1):\n",
        "            stripped = line.strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "            if not stripped or stripped.startswith(\"#\"):\n",
        "                continue\n",
        "\n",
        "            parts = stripped.split(None, 1)\n",
        "\n",
        "            if len(parts) != 2:\n",
        "                manifest_results.append({\n",
        "                    \"line\": line_number,\n",
        "                    \"status\": \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "                    \"entry\": stripped,\n",
        "                    \"details\": \"Unrecognised manifest line format.\"\n",
        "                })\n",
        "                continue\n",
        "\n",
        "            expected_hash = parts[0].lstrip(\"*\").lower()\n",
        "            relative_name = parts[1].strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "            if len(expected_hash) != 64:\n",
        "                manifest_results.append({\n",
        "                    \"line\": line_number,\n",
        "                    \"status\": \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "                    \"entry\": relative_name,\n",
        "                    \"details\": \"Expected hash is not a 64-character SHA-256.\"\n",
        "                })\n",
        "                continue\n",
        "\n",
        "            expected_entries.append({\n",
        "                \"line\": line_number,\n",
        "                \"expected_hash\": expected_hash,\n",
        "                \"filename\": relative_name\n",
        "            })\n",
        "\n",
        "        verified_count = 0\n",
        "        failed_count = 0\n",
        "        unresolved_count = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "        with zipfile.ZipFile(FROZEN_ZIP, \"r\") as archive:\n",
        "            archive_names = archive.namelist()\n",
        "\n",
        "            for entry in expected_entries:\n",
        "                relative_name = entry[\"filename\"].replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\").lstrip(\"./\")\n",
        "                candidates = []\n",
        "\n",
        "                if relative_name in archive_names:\n",
        "                    candidates = [relative_name]\n",
        "                else:\n",
        "                    candidates = [\n",
        "                        name for name in archive_names\n",
        "                        if name.endswith(\"/\" + relative_name)\n",
        "                        or name == relative_name\n",
        "                    ]\n",
        "\n",
        "                if len(candidates) != 1:\n",
        "                    unresolved_count += 1\n",
        "                    manifest_results.append({\n",
        "                        \"line\": entry[\"line\"],\n",
        "                        \"filename\": relative_name,\n",
        "                        \"status\": \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "                        \"details\": (\n",
        "                            f\"Expected exactly one archive match; \"\n",
        "                            f\"found {len(candidates)}.\"\n",
        "                        )\n",
        "                    })\n",
        "                    continue\n",
        "\n",
        "                member_name = candidates[0]\n",
        "                actual_hash = hashlib.sha256(\n",
        "                    archive.read(member_name)\n",
        "                ).hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "                matches = actual_hash == entry[\"expected_hash\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "                if matches:\n",
        "                    verified_count += 1\n",
        "                    status = \"PASS\"\n",
        "                else:\n",
        "                    failed_count += 1\n",
        "                    status = \"FAIL\"\n",
        "\n",
        "                manifest_results.append({\n",
        "                    \"line\": entry[\"line\"],\n",
        "                    \"filename\": relative_name,\n",
        "                    \"archive_member\": member_name,\n",
        "                    \"expected_sha256\": entry[\"expected_hash\"],\n",
        "                    \"actual_sha256\": actual_hash,\n",
        "                    \"status\": status\n",
        "                })\n",
        "\n",
        "        if failed_count > 0:\n",
        "            overall_status = \"FAIL\"\n",
        "        elif unresolved_count > 0:\n",
        "            overall_status = \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            overall_status = \"PASS\"\n",
        "\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Frozen dataset SHA-256 manifest verification\",\n",
        "            overall_status,\n",
        "            f\"Verified={verified_count}; failed={failed_count}; \"\n",
        "            f\"unresolved={unresolved_count}; \"\n",
        "            f\"parsed entries={len(expected_entries)}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Frozen dataset SHA-256 manifest verification\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 6. EMBEDDING AND CHECKPOINT VERIFICATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "embedding_hash = inventory_file(\n",
        "    EMBEDDING_PATH,\n",
        "    \"embedding_output\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "checkpoint_hash = inventory_file(\n",
        "    CHECKPOINT_PATH,\n",
        "    \"embedding_checkpoint\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "if embedding_hash and checkpoint_hash:\n",
        "    if embedding_hash == checkpoint_hash:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Embedding/checkpoint SHA-256 comparison\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Files are byte-identical; SHA256={embedding_hash}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Embedding/checkpoint SHA-256 comparison\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Embedding={embedding_hash}; checkpoint={checkpoint_hash}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Embedding/checkpoint SHA-256 comparison\",\n",
        "        \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "        \"One or both files are missing or unreadable.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 7. STAGE 2 FREEZE MANIFEST\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "freeze_manifest_hash = inventory_file(\n",
        "    FREEZE_MANIFEST_PATH,\n",
        "    \"stage_2_freeze_manifest\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "if freeze_manifest_hash:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with open(FREEZE_MANIFEST_PATH, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "            freeze_manifest_data = json.load(file)\n",
        "\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Stage 2 freeze manifest JSON validity\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Valid JSON; SHA256={freeze_manifest_hash}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            \"Stage 2 freeze manifest JSON validity\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Stage 2 freeze manifest availability\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Missing: {FREEZE_MANIFEST_PATH}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 8. PROJECT-SCOPED ARTIFACT INVENTORY\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "important_directories = [\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"embeddings\",\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_3_3\",\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_2_reproducibility_integrity_review\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "for directory in important_directories:\n",
        "    if not directory.is_dir():\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            f\"Project directory: {directory.name}\",\n",
        "            \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "            f\"Directory missing: {directory}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        continue\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        files = sorted(\n",
        "            path for path in directory.rglob(\"*\")\n",
        "            if path.is_file()\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        for path in files:\n",
        "            # Avoid hashing the same primary files twice.\n",
        "            if path in {\n",
        "                EMBEDDING_PATH,\n",
        "                CHECKPOINT_PATH\n",
        "            }:\n",
        "                continue\n",
        "\n",
        "            inventory_file(path, \"project_scoped_inventory\")\n",
        "\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            f\"Project inventory: {directory.name}\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Inventoried {len(files)} files under {directory}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        record_check(\n",
        "            f\"Project inventory: {directory.name}\",\n",
        "            \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 9. EXISTING PHASE 5.2 AUDIT RECORDS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "existing_audit_records = []\n",
        "\n",
        "if PHASE52_DIR.is_dir():\n",
        "    for path in sorted(PHASE52_DIR.iterdir()):\n",
        "        if path.is_file():\n",
        "            digest = inventory_file(path, \"existing_phase52_audit_record\")\n",
        "\n",
        "            existing_audit_records.append({\n",
        "                \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "                \"size_bytes\": path.stat().st_size,\n",
        "                \"sha256\": digest\n",
        "            })\n",
        "\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Existing Phase 5.2 audit record preservation\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Existing files inventoried: {len(existing_audit_records)}. \"\n",
        "        \"No existing audit record was overwritten.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    record_check(\n",
        "        \"Existing Phase 5.2 audit record preservation\",\n",
        "        \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "        \"Phase 5.2 audit directory was not found.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 10. FINAL STATUS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "status_counts = {\n",
        "    status: sum(1 for check in checks if check[\"status\"] == status)\n",
        "    for status in [\"PASS\", \"FAIL\", \"REVIEW\"]\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "if status_counts[\"FAIL\"] > 0:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"FAIL\"\n",
        "elif status_counts[\"REVIEW\"] > 0:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"PASS\"\n",
        "\n",
        "audit_report = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": \"Experiment 20\",\n",
        "    \"phase\": \"5.2\",\n",
        "    \"title\": \"Reproducibility and Integrity Review\",\n",
        "    \"timestamp_utc\": TIMESTAMP_ISO,\n",
        "    \"overall_status\": overall_status,\n",
        "    \"environment\": {\n",
        "        \"python_version\": sys.version,\n",
        "        \"platform\": platform.platform(),\n",
        "        \"results_root\": str(RESULTS_ROOT),\n",
        "        \"notebook_path\": str(NOTEBOOK_PATH)\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"status_counts\": status_counts,\n",
        "    \"checks\": checks,\n",
        "    \"artifact_inventory\": artifact_inventory,\n",
        "    \"dataset_manifest_results\": manifest_results,\n",
        "    \"existing_phase52_records\": existing_audit_records,\n",
        "    \"interpretation\": (\n",
        "        \"This audit evaluates artifact integrity and traceability. \"\n",
        "        \"It does not establish scientific validity or deployment readiness.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "json_output = (\n",
        "    PHASE52_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_phase52_consolidated_audit_{TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_output = (\n",
        "    PHASE52_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_phase52_consolidated_audit_{TIMESTAMP}.md\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(json_output, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    json.dump(audit_report, file, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines = [\n",
        "    \"# Experiment 20 — Phase 5.2 Consolidated Integrity Audit\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"- Timestamp UTC: {TIMESTAMP_ISO}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Overall status: **{overall_status}**\",\n",
        "    f\"- PASS: {status_counts['PASS']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- FAIL: {status_counts['FAIL']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- REVIEW: {status_counts['REVIEW']}\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Verification results\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"| Check | Status | Details |\",\n",
        "    \"|---|---|---|\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "for check in checks:\n",
        "    details = check[\"details\"].replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\").replace(\"\\n\", \" \")\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "        f\"| {check['check']} | {check['status']} | {details} |\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Artifact inventory\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"Total inventory entries: {len(artifact_inventory)}\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"The complete paths, sizes, and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in the \"\n",
        "    \"companion JSON report.\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Dataset manifest results\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"Manifest entries examined: {len(manifest_results)}\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Interpretation\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    audit_report[\"interpretation\"],\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"Existing research artifacts and previous audit records were not \"\n",
        "    \"overwritten or deleted.\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(markdown_output, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    file.write(\"\\n\".join(markdown_lines))\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"PHASE 5.2 FINAL SUMMARY\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"OVERALL STATUS:\", overall_status)\n",
        "print(\"PASS:\", status_counts[\"PASS\"])\n",
        "print(\"FAIL:\", status_counts[\"FAIL\"])\n",
        "print(\"REVIEW:\", status_counts[\"REVIEW\"])\n",
        "print(\"Inventory entries:\", len(artifact_inventory))\n",
        "print(\"Manifest results:\", len(manifest_results))\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"JSON REPORT:\", json_output)\n",
        "print(\"MARKDOWN REPORT:\", markdown_output)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"DETAILED CHECK RESULTS\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 85)\n",
        "\n",
        "for check in checks:\n",
        "    print(f\"[{check['status']}] {check['check']}\")\n",
        "    print(\"   \", check[\"details\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"Existing audit records were preserved.\")\n",
        "print(\"No existing research artifact was modified.\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "cwaZfC37p--J",
        "outputId": "2cc21b10-a534-45c3-913c-c9cc8b0af164"
      },
