        "\n",
        "# Phase 5.3 — Final Artifact Verification\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Verify that the final Experiment 20 research deliverables are present, readable, and structurally valid before project closure.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Verification scope\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Final Experiment 20 notebook.\n",
        "2. Integrated manuscript, including the latest identified manuscript version.\n",
        "3. Final research figures and image-file integrity.\n",
        "4. Frozen Stage 2 dataset archive.\n",
        "5. Final embedding output.\n",
        "6. Final experiment closure and integrity report.\n",
        "7. Project README and supporting documentation.\n",
        "8. Phase 5.2 consolidated integrity audit reports.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Verification principles\n",
        "\n",
        "- Verify existing artifacts without regenerating them.\n",
        "- Do not modify, rename, move, or delete research files.\n",
        "- Identify missing, empty, unreadable, or structurally invalid artifacts.\n",
        "- Distinguish mandatory deliverables from supporting documentation.\n",
        "- Report exact file paths and sizes for verified artifacts.\n",
        "- Preserve all earlier audit reports.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Acceptance criteria\n",
        "\n",
        "A deliverable is accepted when it exists, is non-empty, and passes the relevant format or readability check.\n",
        "\n",
        "The final verification must explicitly identify any missing or invalid deliverables. A missing expected artifact must not be silently treated as verified.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Limitations\n",
        "\n",
        "This phase verifies deliverable completeness and technical readability. It does not independently validate scientific claims, reproduce experimental findings, establish real-world biometric performance, or establish publication acceptance.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "\n",
        "A timestamped JSON report and a Markdown summary documenting:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Verified final artifacts.\n",
        "- Missing or invalid artifacts.\n",
        "- Supporting documentation.\n",
        "- Final PASS, REVIEW, or FAIL status.\n",
        "- Any remaining issues requiring attention.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "BLOxjMMLuMSF"
      }
    },
