        "\n",
        "# Phase 5.4 — Documentation and Repository Consolidation\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Consolidate the documentation and establish a clear, traceable index of the final Experiment 20 research artifacts.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Verification and consolidation scope\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Identify the principal Experiment 20 research deliverables.\n",
        "2. Inventory README files and supporting Markdown documentation.\n",
        "3. Identify the final manuscript, notebook, figures, frozen dataset, and embedding outputs.\n",
        "4. Identify Phase 5.2 and Phase 5.3 audit reports.\n",
        "5. Inspect available Git repository metadata without changing repository state.\n",
        "6. Generate a consolidated artifact index and documentation report.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Consolidation principles\n",
        "\n",
        "- Preserve existing research files and their directory structure.\n",
        "- Do not overwrite or rewrite existing documentation.\n",
        "- Do not regenerate experimental results.\n",
        "- Do not modify frozen datasets, embeddings, figures, or manuscripts.\n",
        "- Do not initialize a Git repository automatically.\n",
        "- Do not commit, push, rename, move, or delete files.\n",
        "- Record exact paths, file sizes, and SHA-256 hashes for indexed artifacts.\n",
        "- Clearly identify missing documentation or repository metadata.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Acceptance criteria\n",
        "\n",
        "The phase is complete when:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Principal research artifacts are indexed.\n",
        "- Existing documentation is inventoried.\n",
        "- Final audit reports are included in the documentation record.\n",
        "- Git repository status or the absence of repository metadata is explicitly documented.\n",
        "- A consolidated artifact index is generated.\n",
        "- Any outstanding documentation or repository issues are reported.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "\n",
        "A timestamped JSON report and Markdown report containing the consolidated Experiment 20 artifact index, documentation inventory, repository inspection results, and outstanding issues.\n",
        "\n",
        "This phase establishes documentation and traceability. It does not establish publication acceptance or independently validate scientific conclusions.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "XuyI8dzQujeB"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.4\n",
        "# DOCUMENTATION AND REPOSITORY CONSOLIDATION\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# Read-only inspection of existing research artifacts and Git metadata.\n",
        "# Creates a consolidated artifact index and two timestamped reports.\n",
        "# Does not modify, move, rename, commit, or push existing research files.\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import hashlib\n",
        "import platform\n",
        "import sys\n",
        "import subprocess\n",
        "import shutil\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. CONFIGURATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "DRIVE_ROOT = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive\")\n",
        "RESULTS_ROOT = DRIVE_ROOT / \"Experiment_20_Results\"\n",
        "\n",
        "NOTEBOOK_PATH = (\n",
        "    DRIVE_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"Colab Notebooks\"\n",
        "    / \"Experiment 20: Paired Identity-Level Evaluation of Within-Identity \"\n",
        "      \"Embedding Drift Detection Under Multiple Controlled Biometric \"\n",
        "      \"Acquisition Changes.ipynb\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE52_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_2_reproducibility_integrity_review\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE53_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_3_final_artifact_verification\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE54_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_4_documentation_repository_consolidation\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE54_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "TIMESTAMP = datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ\")\n",
        "TIMESTAMP_ISO = datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. HELPERS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "checks = []\n",
        "artifact_index = []\n",
        "documentation_inventory = []\n",
        "\n",
        "def sha256_file(path, chunk_size=1024 * 1024):\n",
        "    digest = hashlib.sha256()\n",
        "\n",
        "    with open(path, \"rb\") as file:\n",
        "        while True:\n",
        "            chunk = file.read(chunk_size)\n",
        "            if not chunk:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "            digest.update(chunk)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return digest.hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def add_check(name, status, details):\n",
        "    checks.append({\n",
        "        \"check\": name,\n",
        "        \"status\": status,\n",
        "        \"details\": str(details)\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def classify_artifact(path):\n",
        "    name = path.name.lower()\n",
        "    suffix = path.suffix.lower()\n",
        "    text_path = str(path).lower()\n",
        "\n",
        "    if path == NOTEBOOK_PATH:\n",
        "        return \"experiment_notebook\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"manuscript\" in name:\n",
        "        return \"manuscript\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"figure\" in name and suffix in {\n",
        "        \".png\", \".jpg\", \".jpeg\", \".tif\", \".tiff\", \".webp\"\n",
        "    }:\n",
        "        return \"research_figure\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"phase52\" in text_path or \"step_5_2\" in text_path:\n",
        "        return \"phase_5_2_audit\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"phase53\" in text_path or \"step_5_3\" in text_path:\n",
        "        return \"phase_5_3_audit\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"closure\" in name:\n",
        "        return \"closure_report\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if \"embedding\" in name or suffix == \".npz\":\n",
        "        return \"embedding_or_data_archive\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if suffix == \".zip\":\n",
        "        return \"frozen_dataset_archive\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if name == \"readme.md\":\n",
        "        return \"readme\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if suffix in {\".md\", \".txt\"}:\n",
        "        return \"supporting_documentation\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    if suffix == \".json\":\n",
        "        return \"structured_metadata_or_audit\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    return \"other_project_artifact\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def index_file(path, category=None):\n",
        "    path = Path(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        if not path.is_file():\n",
        "            return\n",
        "\n",
        "        record = {\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"relative_path\": (\n",
        "                str(path.relative_to(RESULTS_ROOT))\n",
        "                if path.is_relative_to(RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "                else str(path)\n",
        "            ),\n",
        "            \"category\": category or classify_artifact(path),\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": path.stat().st_size,\n",
        "            \"sha256\": sha256_file(path)\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "        artifact_index.append(record)\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Artifact indexing: {path.name}\",\n",
        "            \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.4\")\n",
        "print(\"DOCUMENTATION AND REPOSITORY CONSOLIDATION\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"Timestamp UTC:\", TIMESTAMP_ISO)\n",
        "print(\"Python:\", sys.version)\n",
        "print(\"Platform:\", platform.platform())\n",
        "print(\"Project:\", RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. PROJECT DIRECTORY VALIDATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "if RESULTS_ROOT.is_dir():\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment 20 project directory\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Found project directory: {RESULTS_ROOT}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment 20 project directory\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Project directory missing: {RESULTS_ROOT}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. INVENTORY PROJECT ARTIFACTS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "if RESULTS_ROOT.is_dir():\n",
        "    project_files = sorted(\n",
        "        path for path in RESULTS_ROOT.rglob(\"*\")\n",
        "        if path.is_file()\n",
        "        and PHASE54_DIR not in path.parents\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    for path in project_files:\n",
        "        index_file(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Project artifact inventory\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Indexed {len(artifact_index)} files within Experiment 20 results.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    project_files = []\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Project artifact inventory\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        \"Cannot inventory a missing project directory.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# Include the notebook separately because it is stored outside Results.\n",
        "if NOTEBOOK_PATH.is_file():\n",
        "    index_file(NOTEBOOK_PATH, \"experiment_notebook\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment notebook indexing\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Notebook indexed: {NOTEBOOK_PATH}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Experiment notebook indexing\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Notebook missing: {NOTEBOOK_PATH}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 5. DOCUMENTATION INVENTORY\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "documentation_files = []\n",
        "\n",
        "for path in project_files:\n",
        "    if path.suffix.lower() in {\".md\", \".txt\"}:\n",
        "        documentation_files.append(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "for path in documentation_files:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        content = path.read_text(\n",
        "            encoding=\"utf-8\",\n",
        "            errors=\"replace\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        headings = [\n",
        "            line.strip()\n",
        "            for line in content.splitlines()\n",
        "            if line.strip().startswith(\"#\")\n",
        "        ]\n",
        "\n",
        "        documentation_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"relative_path\": str(path.relative_to(RESULTS_ROOT)),\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": path.stat().st_size,\n",
        "            \"readable\": bool(content.strip()),\n",
        "            \"heading_count\": len(headings),\n",
        "            \"headings\": headings[:30]\n",
        "        })\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        documentation_inventory.append({\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"readable\": False,\n",
        "            \"error\": repr(exc)\n",
        "        })\n",
        "\n",
        "readme_files = [\n",
        "    path for path in documentation_files\n",
        "    if path.name.lower() == \"readme.md\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "if readme_files:\n",
        "    readable_readmes = [\n",
        "        item for item in documentation_inventory\n",
        "        if Path(item[\"path\"]).name.lower() == \"readme.md\"\n",
        "        and item.get(\"readable\") is True\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "\n",
        "    if readable_readmes:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"README documentation inventory\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Found {len(readable_readmes)} readable README files.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"README documentation inventory\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            \"README files were found but none contained readable content.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"README documentation inventory\",\n",
        "        \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "        \"No README.md file was found in the project results directory.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "add_check(\n",
        "    \"Supporting documentation inventory\",\n",
        "    \"PASS\",\n",
        "    f\"Documentation files inventoried: {len(documentation_files)}.\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 6. REQUIRED DELIVERABLE INDEX\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "required_deliverables = {\n",
        "    \"Experiment notebook\": NOTEBOOK_PATH,\n",
        "    \"Integrated manuscript\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "        / \"step_3330\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_integrated_manuscript_v2.md\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Frozen Stage 2 dataset\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Frozen_Dataset.zip\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Embedding output\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"embeddings\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_croppedyale_facenet_embeddings.npz\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Final closure report\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "        / \"step_3336\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_step3336_final_integrity_and_closure_report.json\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "for name, path in required_deliverables.items():\n",
        "    if path.is_file() and path.stat().st_size > 0:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Required deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Present; size={path.stat().st_size} bytes.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Required deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Missing or empty: {path}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "# Check the four expected research figures by their filename pattern.\n",
        "figure_files = [\n",
        "    path for path in project_files\n",
        "    if \"figure\" in path.name.lower()\n",
        "    and path.suffix.lower() in {\n",
        "        \".png\", \".jpg\", \".jpeg\", \".tif\", \".tiff\", \".webp\"\n",
        "    }\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "if len(figure_files) >= 4:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Research figure inventory\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Found {len(figure_files)} figure image files.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Research figure inventory\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Expected at least four figure images; found {len(figure_files)}.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 7. PHASE 5.2 AND 5.3 REPORT INVENTORY\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "for phase_name, directory in [\n",
        "    (\"Phase 5.2\", PHASE52_DIR),\n",
        "    (\"Phase 5.3\", PHASE53_DIR)\n",
        "]:\n",
        "    if not directory.is_dir():\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"{phase_name} report directory\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Missing directory: {directory}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        continue\n",
        "\n",
        "    json_files = list(directory.glob(\"*.json\"))\n",
        "    markdown_files = list(directory.glob(\"*.md\"))\n",
        "\n",
        "    valid_json = 0\n",
        "    readable_markdown = 0\n",
        "\n",
        "    for path in json_files:\n",
        "        try:\n",
        "            with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "                json.load(file)\n",
        "            valid_json += 1\n",
        "        except Exception:\n",
        "            pass\n",
        "\n",
        "    for path in markdown_files:\n",
        "        try:\n",
        "            if path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip():\n",
        "                readable_markdown += 1\n",
        "        except Exception:\n",
        "            pass\n",
        "\n",
        "    if valid_json > 0 and readable_markdown > 0:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"{phase_name} audit documentation\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Valid JSON reports={valid_json}; \"\n",
        "            f\"readable Markdown reports={readable_markdown}.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"{phase_name} audit documentation\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Missing or invalid audit report pair. \"\n",
        "            f\"JSON={valid_json}; Markdown={readable_markdown}.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 8. GIT REPOSITORY METADATA INSPECTION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "git_executable = shutil.which(\"git\")\n",
        "git_information = {\n",
        "    \"git_available\": bool(git_executable),\n",
        "    \"repository_detected\": False,\n",
        "    \"repository_root\": None,\n",
        "    \"branch\": None,\n",
        "    \"working_tree_status\": None,\n",
        "    \"inspection_note\": None\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "if git_executable and RESULTS_ROOT.is_dir():\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        root_result = subprocess.run(\n",
        "            [\"git\", \"-C\", str(RESULTS_ROOT), \"rev-parse\", \"--show-toplevel\"],\n",
        "            capture_output=True,\n",
        "            text=True,\n",
        "            timeout=20\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        if root_result.returncode == 0:\n",
        "            repository_root = root_result.stdout.strip()\n",
        "            git_information[\"repository_detected\"] = True\n",
        "            git_information[\"repository_root\"] = repository_root\n",
        "\n",
        "            branch_result = subprocess.run(\n",
        "                [\"git\", \"-C\", str(RESULTS_ROOT), \"branch\", \"--show-current\"],\n",
        "                capture_output=True,\n",
        "                text=True,\n",
        "                timeout=20\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            if branch_result.returncode == 0:\n",
        "                git_information[\"branch\"] = (\n",
        "                    branch_result.stdout.strip() or \"(detached HEAD)\"\n",
        "                )\n",
        "\n",
        "            status_result = subprocess.run(\n",
        "                [\"git\", \"-C\", str(RESULTS_ROOT), \"status\", \"--short\"],\n",
        "                capture_output=True,\n",
        "                text=True,\n",
        "                timeout=20\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            if status_result.returncode == 0:\n",
        "                git_information[\"working_tree_status\"] = (\n",
        "                    status_result.stdout.strip()\n",
        "                )\n",
        "\n",
        "            add_check(\n",
        "                \"Git repository metadata\",\n",
        "                \"PASS\",\n",
        "                f\"Repository detected at {repository_root}; \"\n",
        "                f\"branch={git_information['branch']}.\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            git_information[\"inspection_note\"] = (\n",
        "                \"No Git repository detected at the project directory \"\n",
        "                \"or its parent directories.\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "            add_check(\n",
        "                \"Git repository metadata\",\n",
        "                \"PASS\",\n",
        "                git_information[\"inspection_note\"]\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        git_information[\"inspection_note\"] = repr(exc)\n",
        "\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"Git repository metadata inspection\",\n",
        "            \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "elif not git_executable:\n",
        "    git_information[\"inspection_note\"] = (\n",
        "        \"Git executable is not available in this runtime.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Git repository metadata inspection\",\n",
        "        \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "        git_information[\"inspection_note\"]\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 9. CONSOLIDATED ARTIFACT INDEX\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "artifact_index.sort(\n",
        "    key=lambda item: (\n",
        "        item[\"category\"],\n",
        "        item[\"relative_path\"]\n",
        "    )\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "index_path = (\n",
        "    PHASE54_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_consolidated_artifact_index_{TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(index_path, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    json.dump(\n",
        "        artifact_index,\n",
        "        file,\n",
        "        indent=2,\n",
        "        ensure_ascii=False\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 10. FINAL STATUS AND REPORTS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "status_counts = {\n",
        "    status: sum(\n",
        "        1 for item in checks\n",
        "        if item[\"status\"] == status\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    for status in [\"PASS\", \"FAIL\", \"REVIEW\"]\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "if status_counts[\"FAIL\"] > 0:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"FAIL\"\n",
        "elif status_counts[\"REVIEW\"] > 0:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    overall_status = \"PASS\"\n",
        "\n",
        "final_report = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": \"Experiment 20\",\n",
        "    \"phase\": \"5.4\",\n",
        "    \"title\": \"Documentation and Repository Consolidation\",\n",
        "    \"timestamp_utc\": TIMESTAMP_ISO,\n",
        "    \"overall_status\": overall_status,\n",
        "    \"status_counts\": status_counts,\n",
        "    \"environment\": {\n",
        "        \"python_version\": sys.version,\n",
        "        \"platform\": platform.platform(),\n",
        "        \"results_root\": str(RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    \"artifact_index_path\": str(index_path),\n",
        "    \"artifact_count\": len(artifact_index),\n",
        "    \"documentation_count\": len(documentation_inventory),\n",
        "    \"documentation_inventory\": documentation_inventory,\n",
        "    \"git_information\": git_information,\n",
        "    \"checks\": checks,\n",
        "    \"principles\": [\n",
        "        \"Existing research artifacts were not modified.\",\n",
        "        \"No files were moved, renamed, or deleted.\",\n",
        "        \"No Git commit or push was performed.\",\n",
        "        \"No experimental results were regenerated.\"\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "json_report_path = (\n",
        "    PHASE54_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_phase54_consolidation_report_{TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_report_path = (\n",
        "    PHASE54_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_phase54_consolidation_report_{TIMESTAMP}.md\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(json_report_path, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    json.dump(final_report, file, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines = [\n",
        "    \"# Experiment 20 — Phase 5.4 Documentation and Repository Consolidation\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"- Timestamp UTC: {TIMESTAMP_ISO}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Overall status: **{overall_status}**\",\n",
        "    f\"- PASS: {status_counts['PASS']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- FAIL: {status_counts['FAIL']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- REVIEW: {status_counts['REVIEW']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Indexed project artifacts: {len(artifact_index)}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Documentation files: {len(documentation_inventory)}\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Consolidated artifact index\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"Index file: `{index_path}`\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Documentation inventory\",\n",
        "    \"\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in documentation_inventory:\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "        f\"- `{item['relative_path']}` — \"\n",
        "        f\"readable={item.get('readable', False)}, \"\n",
        "        f\"headings={item.get('heading_count', 0)}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Git repository inspection\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"- Git available: {git_information['git_available']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Repository detected: {git_information['repository_detected']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Repository root: {git_information['repository_root']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Branch: {git_information['branch']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Working tree status: {git_information['working_tree_status']}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Note: {git_information['inspection_note']}\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Verification results\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"| Check | Status | Details |\",\n",
        "    \"|---|---|---|\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in checks:\n",
        "    details = item[\"details\"].replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\").replace(\"\\n\", \" \")\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "        f\"| {item['check']} | {item['status']} | {details} |\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Preservation statement\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"- Existing research artifacts were not modified.\",\n",
        "    \"- No files were moved, renamed, or deleted.\",\n",
        "    \"- No Git commit or push was performed.\",\n",
        "    \"- No experimental results were regenerated.\",\n",
        "    \"\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(markdown_report_path, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    file.write(\"\\n\".join(markdown_lines))\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 11. PRINT RESULTS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"PHASE 5.4 FINAL SUMMARY\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"OVERALL STATUS:\", overall_status)\n",
        "print(\"PASS:\", status_counts[\"PASS\"])\n",
        "print(\"FAIL:\", status_counts[\"FAIL\"])\n",
        "print(\"REVIEW:\", status_counts[\"REVIEW\"])\n",
        "print(\"Indexed project artifacts:\", len(artifact_index))\n",
        "print(\"Documentation files:\", len(documentation_inventory))\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"GIT REPOSITORY INFORMATION\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 85)\n",
        "print(json.dumps(git_information, indent=2))\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"DETAILED CHECK RESULTS\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 85)\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in checks:\n",
        "    print(f\"[{item['status']}] {item['check']}\")\n",
        "    print(\"   \", item[\"details\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"ARTIFACT INDEX:\", index_path)\n",
        "print(\"JSON REPORT:\", json_report_path)\n",
        "print(\"MARKDOWN REPORT:\", markdown_report_path)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"No existing research artifacts were intentionally modified.\")\n",
        "print(\"No Git commit or push was performed.\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n"
      ],
