    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# Phase 5.5 — Final Project Closure and Completion Report\n",
        "\n",
        "## Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "Produce the definitive closure record for Experiment 20 by consolidating the completed integrity, artifact verification, and documentation phases.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Closure scope\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Review the recorded results of Phase 5.2 — Reproducibility and Integrity Review.\n",
        "2. Review the recorded results of Phase 5.3 — Final Artifact Verification.\n",
        "3. Review the recorded results of Phase 5.4 — Documentation and Repository Consolidation.\n",
        "4. Confirm the presence of the principal research deliverables.\n",
        "5. Record the final manuscript, notebook, frozen dataset, embedding output, figures, and supporting documentation.\n",
        "6. Consolidate the limitations and outstanding issues.\n",
        "7. Generate the final project closure report.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Closure principles\n",
        "\n",
        "- Use existing phase reports as the evidence base.\n",
        "- Do not regenerate experiments or research outputs.\n",
        "- Do not modify frozen datasets, embeddings, manuscripts, or figures.\n",
        "- Do not overwrite earlier phase reports.\n",
        "- Do not claim scientific reproducibility beyond the checks actually performed.\n",
        "- Clearly distinguish administrative project completion from publication readiness.\n",
        "- Preserve the complete audit trail.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Administrative closure criteria\n",
        "\n",
        "Experiment 20 may be marked administratively closed when:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Phases 5.2, 5.3, and 5.4 have successful recorded outcomes.\n",
        "- Principal research deliverables are present.\n",
        "- Final audit reports are readable.\n",
        "- The consolidated artifact index is available.\n",
        "- Limitations and repository status are documented.\n",
        "- The final closure report is successfully generated.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Expected outcome\n",
        "\n",
        "A timestamped final JSON closure report and a Markdown completion report.\n",
        "\n",
        "The report will state the final administrative status, summarize the verified deliverables, identify limitations, and preserve references to the supporting phase reports.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Important distinction\n",
        "\n",
        "Administrative closure does not establish independent scientific validation, real-world biometric performance, fairness, deployment readiness, or publication acceptance. Those require separate evidence and review.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "y1Ejzfs6vAxR"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.5\n",
        "# FINAL PROJECT CLOSURE AND COMPLETION REPORT\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "# Consolidates the recorded evidence from Phases 5.2, 5.3, and 5.4.\n",
        "#\n",
        "# Existing research artifacts and audit reports are read-only.\n",
        "# Creates a new final JSON closure report and Markdown completion report.\n",
        "# Does not regenerate experiments, overwrite reports, or modify research data.\n",
        "# =============================================================================\n",
        "\n",
        "import json\n",
        "import hashlib\n",
        "import platform\n",
        "import sys\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from datetime import datetime, timezone\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 1. CONFIGURATION\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "DRIVE_ROOT = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive\")\n",
        "RESULTS_ROOT = DRIVE_ROOT / \"Experiment_20_Results\"\n",
        "\n",
        "NOTEBOOK_PATH = (\n",
        "    DRIVE_ROOT\n",
        "    / \"Colab Notebooks\"\n",
        "    / \"Experiment 20: Paired Identity-Level Evaluation of Within-Identity \"\n",
        "      \"Embedding Drift Detection Under Multiple Controlled Biometric \"\n",
        "      \"Acquisition Changes.ipynb\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE52_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_2_reproducibility_integrity_review\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE53_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_3_final_artifact_verification\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE54_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_4_documentation_repository_consolidation\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE55_DIR = (\n",
        "    RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_5_5_final_project_closure\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "PHASE55_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "TIMESTAMP = datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ\")\n",
        "TIMESTAMP_ISO = datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 2. HELPERS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "closure_checks = []\n",
        "phase_evidence = {}\n",
        "deliverable_inventory = []\n",
        "\n",
        "def sha256_file(path, chunk_size=1024 * 1024):\n",
        "    digest = hashlib.sha256()\n",
        "\n",
        "    with open(path, \"rb\") as file:\n",
        "        while True:\n",
        "            chunk = file.read(chunk_size)\n",
        "            if not chunk:\n",
        "                break\n",
        "            digest.update(chunk)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return digest.hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def add_check(name, status, details):\n",
        "    closure_checks.append({\n",
        "        \"check\": name,\n",
        "        \"status\": status,\n",
        "        \"details\": str(details)\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def latest_report(directory, pattern):\n",
        "    if not directory.is_dir():\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    candidates = sorted(\n",
        "        directory.glob(pattern),\n",
        "        key=lambda path: path.stat().st_mtime,\n",
        "        reverse=True\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    return candidates[0] if candidates else None\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def load_json_report(phase_name, path):\n",
        "    if path is None:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"{phase_name} report availability\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            \"No matching report file was found.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with open(path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "            data = json.load(file)\n",
        "\n",
        "        recorded_status = data.get(\"overall_status\")\n",
        "\n",
        "        if recorded_status not in {\"PASS\", \"FAIL\", \"REVIEW\"}:\n",
        "            add_check(\n",
        "                f\"{phase_name} report status\",\n",
        "                \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "                f\"Report exists but has no recognized overall_status: {path}\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "        else:\n",
        "            add_check(\n",
        "                f\"{phase_name} report status\",\n",
        "                recorded_status,\n",
        "                f\"Recorded status={recorded_status}; report={path}\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "        return {\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"overall_status\": recorded_status,\n",
        "            \"timestamp_utc\": data.get(\"timestamp_utc\"),\n",
        "            \"status_counts\": data.get(\"status_counts\"),\n",
        "            \"report_data\": data\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"{phase_name} report readability\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"{path}: {repr(exc)}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def inspect_deliverable(name, path, required=True):\n",
        "    path = Path(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "    if not path.is_file():\n",
        "        status = \"FAIL\" if required else \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Final deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "            status,\n",
        "            f\"Missing file: {path}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        size = path.stat().st_size\n",
        "\n",
        "        if size == 0:\n",
        "            add_check(\n",
        "                f\"Final deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "                \"FAIL\",\n",
        "                f\"File is empty: {path}\"\n",
        "            )\n",
        "            return None\n",
        "\n",
        "        digest = sha256_file(path)\n",
        "\n",
        "        record = {\n",
        "            \"name\": name,\n",
        "            \"path\": str(path),\n",
        "            \"size_bytes\": size,\n",
        "            \"sha256\": digest\n",
        "        }\n",
        "\n",
        "        deliverable_inventory.append(record)\n",
        "\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Final deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Present; size={size} bytes; SHA256={digest}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        return record\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            f\"Final deliverable: {name}\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Unable to inspect {path}: {repr(exc)}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        return None\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — PHASE 5.5\")\n",
        "print(\"FINAL PROJECT CLOSURE\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"Timestamp UTC:\", TIMESTAMP_ISO)\n",
        "print(\"Python:\", sys.version)\n",
        "print(\"Platform:\", platform.platform())\n",
        "print(\"Project directory:\", RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 3. LOAD THE LATEST COMPLETED PHASE REPORTS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "phase_report_paths = {\n",
        "    \"Phase 5.2\": latest_report(\n",
        "        PHASE52_DIR,\n",
        "        \"experiment20_phase52_consolidated_audit_*.json\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Phase 5.3\": latest_report(\n",
        "        PHASE53_DIR,\n",
        "        \"experiment20_phase53_final_artifact_verification_*.json\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    \"Phase 5.4\": latest_report(\n",
        "        PHASE54_DIR,\n",
        "        \"experiment20_phase54_consolidation_report_*.json\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "for phase_name, report_path in phase_report_paths.items():\n",
        "    phase_evidence[phase_name] = load_json_report(\n",
        "        phase_name,\n",
        "        report_path\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 4. VERIFY REQUIRED FINAL DELIVERABLES\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "required_deliverables = {\n",
        "    \"Experiment 20 notebook\": NOTEBOOK_PATH,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"Integrated manuscript v2\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "        / \"step_3330\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_integrated_manuscript_v2.md\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"Frozen Stage 2 dataset archive\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"Experiment_20_Stage_2_Frozen_Dataset.zip\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"FaceNet embedding output\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"embeddings\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_croppedyale_facenet_embeddings.npz\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"Final experiment closure report\": (\n",
        "        RESULTS_ROOT\n",
        "        / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "        / \"step_3336\"\n",
        "        / \"experiment20_step3336_final_integrity_and_closure_report.json\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "for name, path in required_deliverables.items():\n",
        "    inspect_deliverable(name, path, required=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 5. VERIFY RESEARCH FIGURES\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "figure_extensions = {\n",
        "    \".png\", \".jpg\", \".jpeg\", \".tif\", \".tiff\", \".webp\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "step33_root = RESULTS_ROOT / \"step_3_3\"\n",
        "\n",
        "figure_paths = []\n",
        "\n",
        "if step33_root.is_dir():\n",
        "    figure_paths = sorted(\n",
        "        path for path in step33_root.rglob(\"*\")\n",
        "        if path.is_file()\n",
        "        and \"figure\" in path.name.lower()\n",
        "        and path.suffix.lower() in figure_extensions\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "if len(figure_paths) >= 4:\n",
        "    figure_records = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for figure_path in figure_paths:\n",
        "        record = inspect_deliverable(\n",
        "            f\"Research figure — {figure_path.name}\",\n",
        "            figure_path,\n",
        "            required=True\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        if record:\n",
        "            figure_records.append(record)\n",
        "\n",
        "    if len(figure_records) == len(figure_paths):\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"Research figure collection\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"All {len(figure_records)} identified figure files were indexed.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"Research figure collection\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            f\"Only {len(figure_records)} of {len(figure_paths)} \"\n",
        "            \"identified figure files were successfully inspected.\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Research figure collection\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        f\"Expected at least four figure files; found {len(figure_paths)}.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 6. VERIFY DOCUMENTATION AND ARTIFACT INDEX\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "readme_files = list(RESULTS_ROOT.rglob(\"README.md\"))\n",
        "\n",
        "readable_readmes = []\n",
        "\n",
        "for path in readme_files:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        if path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip():\n",
        "            readable_readmes.append(path)\n",
        "    except Exception:\n",
        "        pass\n",
        "\n",
        "if readable_readmes:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Project README documentation\",\n",
        "        \"PASS\",\n",
        "        f\"Found {len(readable_readmes)} readable README files.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Project README documentation\",\n",
        "        \"REVIEW\",\n",
        "        \"No readable README.md file was identified.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "artifact_index_path = latest_report(\n",
        "    PHASE54_DIR,\n",
        "    \"experiment20_consolidated_artifact_index_*.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "if artifact_index_path:\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        with open(artifact_index_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "            artifact_index_data = json.load(file)\n",
        "\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"Consolidated artifact index\",\n",
        "            \"PASS\",\n",
        "            f\"Readable index; entries={len(artifact_index_data)}; \"\n",
        "            f\"path={artifact_index_path}\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    except Exception as exc:\n",
        "        add_check(\n",
        "            \"Consolidated artifact index\",\n",
        "            \"FAIL\",\n",
        "            repr(exc)\n",
        "        )\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    add_check(\n",
        "        \"Consolidated artifact index\",\n",
        "        \"FAIL\",\n",
        "        \"Phase 5.4 consolidated artifact index was not found.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 7. RECORD KNOWN PROJECT LIMITATIONS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "limitations = [\n",
        "    (\n",
        "        \"The integrity checks verify artifact consistency and file \"\n",
        "        \"readability; they do not independently reproduce the experiments.\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    (\n",
        "        \"The evaluated results do not, by themselves, establish \"\n",
        "        \"real-world biometric recognition accuracy or deployment readiness.\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    (\n",
        "        \"Fairness claims require appropriate dedicated evaluation and \"\n",
        "        \"supporting evidence.\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    (\n",
        "        \"No local Git repository was detected inside the Experiment 20 \"\n",
        "        \"results directory or its parent directories during Phase 5.4.\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    (\n",
        "        \"Publication acceptance has not been established by these \"\n",
        "        \"administrative closure checks.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 8. DETERMINE FINAL ADMINISTRATIVE STATUS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "phase_statuses = {\n",
        "    phase_name: (\n",
        "        evidence.get(\"overall_status\")\n",
        "        if evidence else None\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    for phase_name, evidence in phase_evidence.items()\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "all_phases_pass = (\n",
        "    len(phase_statuses) == 3\n",
        "    and all(status == \"PASS\" for status in phase_statuses.values())\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "failure_count = sum(\n",
        "    1 for item in closure_checks\n",
        "    if item[\"status\"] == \"FAIL\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "review_count = sum(\n",
        "    1 for item in closure_checks\n",
        "    if item[\"status\"] == \"REVIEW\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "if failure_count > 0:\n",
        "    final_status = \"NOT_CLOSED\"\n",
        "elif review_count > 0:\n",
        "    final_status = \"CLOSURE_REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n",
        "elif all_phases_pass:\n",
        "    final_status = \"ADMINISTRATIVELY_CLOSED\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    final_status = \"CLOSURE_REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n",
        "\n",
        "add_check(\n",
        "    \"Final administrative closure decision\",\n",
        "    \"PASS\" if final_status == \"ADMINISTRATIVELY_CLOSED\" else (\n",
        "        \"FAIL\" if final_status == \"NOT_CLOSED\" else \"REVIEW\"\n",
        "    ),\n",
        "    f\"Final status={final_status}; phase statuses={phase_statuses}\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 9. BUILD FINAL CLOSURE REPORT\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "final_report = {\n",
        "    \"experiment\": \"Experiment 20\",\n",
        "    \"phase\": \"5.5\",\n",
        "    \"title\": \"Final Project Closure and Completion Report\",\n",
        "    \"timestamp_utc\": TIMESTAMP_ISO,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"final_administrative_status\": final_status,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"phase_summary\": {\n",
        "        phase_name: {\n",
        "            \"report_path\": evidence.get(\"path\") if evidence else None,\n",
        "            \"recorded_status\": (\n",
        "                evidence.get(\"overall_status\") if evidence else None\n",
        "            ),\n",
        "            \"timestamp_utc\": (\n",
        "                evidence.get(\"timestamp_utc\") if evidence else None\n",
        "            ),\n",
        "            \"status_counts\": (\n",
        "                evidence.get(\"status_counts\") if evidence else None\n",
        "            )\n",
        "        }\n",
        "        for phase_name, evidence in phase_evidence.items()\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"verified_deliverables\": deliverable_inventory,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"research_figures\": [\n",
        "        str(path) for path in figure_paths\n",
        "    ],\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"documentation\": {\n",
        "        \"readme_files\": [str(path) for path in readable_readmes],\n",
        "        \"artifact_index_path\": (\n",
        "            str(artifact_index_path) if artifact_index_path else None\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"limitations\": limitations,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"closure_checks\": closure_checks,\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"environment\": {\n",
        "        \"python_version\": sys.version,\n",
        "        \"platform\": platform.platform(),\n",
        "        \"results_root\": str(RESULTS_ROOT)\n",
        "    },\n",
        "\n",
        "    \"interpretation\": (\n",
        "        \"Administrative closure is based on the recorded successful \"\n",
        "        \"outcomes of Phases 5.2, 5.3, and 5.4 and the final deliverable \"\n",
        "        \"checks performed in Phase 5.5. It does not constitute independent \"\n",
        "        \"scientific validation, publication acceptance, or deployment approval.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 10. SAVE FINAL JSON AND MARKDOWN REPORTS\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "json_report_path = (\n",
        "    PHASE55_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_final_project_closure_{TIMESTAMP}.json\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_report_path = (\n",
        "    PHASE55_DIR\n",
        "    / f\"experiment20_final_project_closure_{TIMESTAMP}.md\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(json_report_path, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    json.dump(\n",
        "        final_report,\n",
        "        file,\n",
        "        indent=2,\n",
        "        ensure_ascii=False\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines = [\n",
        "    \"# Experiment 20 — Final Project Closure Report\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"- Closure date (UTC): {TIMESTAMP_ISO}\",\n",
        "    f\"- Final administrative status: **{final_status}**\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Phase completion summary\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"| Phase | Recorded status | Report |\",\n",
        "    \"|---|---|---|\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "for phase_name, evidence in phase_evidence.items():\n",
        "    if evidence:\n",
        "        markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "            f\"| {phase_name} | {evidence.get('overall_status')} \"\n",
        "            f\"| `{evidence.get('path')}` |\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "            f\"| {phase_name} | MISSING | Not available |\"\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Verified principal deliverables\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"| Deliverable | Size (bytes) | SHA-256 |\",\n",
        "    \"|---|---:|---|\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in deliverable_inventory:\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "        f\"| {item['name']} | {item['size_bytes']} \"\n",
        "        f\"| `{item['sha256']}` |\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Research figures\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"Identified figure files: {len(figure_paths)}\",\n",
        "    \"\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "for path in figure_paths:\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(f\"- `{path}`\")\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Documentation and artifact index\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"Readable README files: {len(readable_readmes)}\",\n",
        "    f\"Consolidated artifact index: `{artifact_index_path}`\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Limitations and outstanding distinctions\",\n",
        "    \"\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "for limitation in limitations:\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(f\"- {limitation}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Closure verification results\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"| Check | Status | Details |\",\n",
        "    \"|---|---|---|\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in closure_checks:\n",
        "    details = item[\"details\"].replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\").replace(\"\\n\", \" \")\n",
        "    markdown_lines.append(\n",
        "        f\"| {item['check']} | {item['status']} | {details} |\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "markdown_lines.extend([\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"## Final decision\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    f\"**{final_status}**\",\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    final_report[\"interpretation\"],\n",
        "    \"\",\n",
        "    \"No existing research artifacts or earlier audit reports were \"\n",
        "    \"intentionally modified, overwritten, moved, or deleted.\"\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "with open(markdown_report_path, \"x\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n",
        "    file.write(\"\\n\".join(markdown_lines))\n",
        "\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "# 11. PRINT FINAL SUMMARY\n",
        "# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "print(\"EXPERIMENT 20 — FINAL PROJECT CLOSURE\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 85)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"FINAL ADMINISTRATIVE STATUS:\", final_status)\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"PHASE STATUS SUMMARY\")\n",
        "\n",
        "for phase_name, status in phase_statuses.items():\n",
        "    print(f\"{phase_name}: {status}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"DELIVERABLES VERIFIED:\", len(deliverable_inventory))\n",
        "print(\"RESEARCH FIGURES IDENTIFIED:\", len(figure_paths))\n",
        "print(\"READABLE README FILES:\", len(readable_readmes))\n",
        "print(\"CLOSURE CHECKS:\", len(closure_checks))\n",
        "print(\"FAILED CHECKS:\", failure_count)\n",
        "print(\"REVIEW CHECKS:\", review_count)\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"DETAILED CLOSURE CHECKS\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 85)\n",
        "\n",
        "for item in closure_checks:\n",
        "    print(f\"[{item['status']}] {item['check']}\")\n",
        "    print(\"   \", item[\"details\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "print()\n",
        "print(\"FINAL JSON REPORT:\", json_report_path)\n",
        "print(\"FINAL MARKDOWN REPORT:\", markdown_report_path)\n",
        "print()\n",
